<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Musamu Wumbote wu Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Musamu wumbote wu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni musamu wumbote wu sonika Luka. Luka kadi ntumwa yimosi yi Yesu ko, kansi wuba kintwadi na bantu bedi kwe zyetingi na Yesu, mu bafuula bwedi bubeela kizingu ki Yesu natee buka toma we bakula bumbote. Mboki, wusonika buuku bedidi ku muntu wu bakwe tumisinanga ti Teofile. Luka wuba dokotolo, wuzyeta ntangu zizingi na ntumwa Pawuli. Mu bamvimba basonika Masonama, ni yandi kwandi wulembolo ba Muyudayo. Kansi wuta bwedi budi kinkulu ki Bayudayo, mwanki bakundi bandi batoma bakula Yesu nani kadi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka wuta ti Bayudayo bedi kingilanga ntinu ya kwiza bavuukisa. Ni mvulusi, yisamuna mimbikudi mi Nzambi mu Masonama mata ti: Nzambi waamutambika. Nzambi wuzaba ti tala ti Muvuukisi kadi ko, buna yeto bamvimba twaaba bantu bazimbala. Wutambika Mwana andi wumosi kaka mu kwiza vuukisa yobobo bamvimba ba mu kwikila, yobobo ba kadi nsi. Mwana bewowo ni Yesu-Klisto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka wuta mu buuku bedidi bwedi Yesu kabutukila, mpe nkye misamu kahidika ha luse lu butoto, na nkye misamu kalonga kuu bantu, bumosi mpe mfwilu na mfulukulu andi mu bafwa. Yesu wulonga bantu mu kibakala, wunyakisa zimbevo, wukuma mpeve zimbi, mpe wuhidika misamu mimingi milembolo bakula bantu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka wusonika dyaka buuku dinzole: didi buuku di «Bisalu bi Zintumwa.» Wuzonzila misamu mibwabana zintumwa, ku tonina ku ntombokolo yi Yesu ku mazulu, mpe bwedi luzingu mu Klisto lukotila ntete mu nsi zimvimba.</para>
  <para style="iot">Tala bonso budi ndandani yi misamu mu buuku disonika Luka:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Kibila kisonikina Luka buuku bedidi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1.1-4</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Bwedi bubeela mbutukulu yi Yoane Mumbotiki na yi Yesu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1.5–2.52</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Ndongolo yi Yoane Mumbotiki (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3.1-20</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Mbotokolo yi Yesu, na bwedi nkadyampemba kasosila mu mubwisa mu masumu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3.21–4.13</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Yesu wuyenda zakala ku Ngalili (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4.14–9.50</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Yesu totokidi mu Ngalili mu kwe zakala ku Yelusalemi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9.51–19.27</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Lumingu lu mansukina lu Yesu ha butoto: mfundusu andi na lufwa lwandi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19.28–23.56</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">8) Mfulukulu yi Yesu mu lufwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">24.1-12</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">9) Yesu wuyenika ku milongoki myandi, na wuyenda ku yulu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:13-53">24.13-53</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mbadukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Bantu babingi batontidi mu sonika ndandani yi misamu mihyokidi ha kati dyeto.<verse eid="LUK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Yawu basonikini myo bonso bu tutedidi zimbangi zimona meso, ziba tuka kuntonono mpe ziyizi ba bisadi mu mwangisa mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Meno mpe hahoho bu natomini sosa mu zaba misamu bemyomyo tuka ku ntonono, nayeni ti bumbote mu kusonikina, ngeye mbuta Teofile, ndandani yi misamu bemyomyo, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />mwanki wuzaba bukedika bu zindongosolo zi wutambudi.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbazi yizabikisa mbutukulu yi Yoane Mbotiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Mu ntangu Elode kaba ntinu mu kizunga ki Yuda, kuba na nganga-Nzambi yimosi nkumbu andi Zakaliya. Yandi wuba mu kabu di zinganga-Nzambi di Abya. Mukazi andi wuba mu nkuna yi Aloni, nkumbu andi Elizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Ya babole baba bantu baludedomo ha meso ma Nzambi na bavumina mina na Misiku mi Mfumu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Kansi baba na mwana ko, mu dyambu ti Elizabeti wuba kisita, mpe ya babole bayiza ba binunu.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Kilumbu kimosi, Zakaliya bu kedi sala kisalu kyandi ki bunganga-Nzambi mu kati di nzo-Nzambi, mu dyambu ti yiyiza ba ntangu yi kabu dyandi mu sala. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Basa nsololo, bonso buba kifu ki zinganga-Nzambi, ni yibwa mu Zakaliya mu kota mu nzo-Nzambi mu fwitisa maaka mamfuku yimbote. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Mpumbu yimvimba yi bantu yedi sambila ku mbazi mu ntangu yedi fwita maaka mamfuku yimbote. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Mboki, Mbazi yi Mfumu yiyiza mu yenikina. Yiba yitelama ha ntendo ziku di bakwe fwitisilanga maaka mamfuku yimbote, ku kooko ku lubakala. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakaliya bu kayena mbazi beyoyo, wupamuka na wutekita bubwingi. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Kansi Mbazi wumuteela ti: «Zakaliya, kuyenandi bunkuta ko, Nzambi tambudi lusambulu lwaku: Elizabeti, mukazi aku, mwana wubakala kana kubutila, mbo wumuhaana nkumbu yi Yoane. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Waaba mu kyese na mayangi, mpe babingi baayangalala mu mbutukulu andi. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Mu dyambu ti, muntu wumfunu kana ba ha ntadisi yi Mfumu. Kana nwa vinu na malamu makwe kolongo ko. Waaba wufuluka mu Mpeve Yilongo tuka mu moyo wu ngudi andi. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Yandi Waavutula ba-Isaeli babingi ku Mfumu Nzambi awu. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Yandi waatekila ku mutwala wu Mfumu na mpeve na lulendo lu Eliya, mu vutula luwawanu ha kati di matata na baala bawu na waasa ti bantu ba mutu wungolo baba na ndwenga zi bantu baludedomo, mwanki ka kubikila Mfumu mukangu wukubama mu yandi.» <verse eid="LUK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Kansi Zakaliya wuteela mbazi ti: «Bwedi naazabila ti wukedika wudi e? Kadi meno na mukazi ani tweka banuna.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Mbazi yi muteela ti: «Meno ni Ngabileli, kwe telamanga ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. Yandi wu mfidisi ku ngeye, mu kwiza kuteela musamu bewuwu wumbote.» <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Bulembolo kwikila mu musamu wu nakutedidi, baba waakituka na waabwesa zonza ko, natee kilumbu kya lunga mi nakuteedidi.<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mu ntangu beyoyo, mpumbu yi bantu yedi kingilanga Zakaliya, bakifuula nki kedi zingidila mu kati di kihinga kilongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Bu katotoka, kedi bwesa lenda mu zonza nawu ko. Ni babakula ti dyambu kayeni mu kati di kihinga kilongo. Mu kulabikisa kedi bazonzila, mpe wutatamana mu ba baaba.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Zakaliya bu kamanisa bilumbu byandi bi kisalu, wuvutuka ku nzo andi. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Mwa bilumbu kwandi bihyoka, mukazi andi Elizabeti wubaka zimi. Elizabeti wuswama ngonda tanu mu nzo, mboki wuta ti: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Tala bonso Mfumu kasiidi mu meno. Yandi wunkatudi nsoni ha meso ma bantu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbazi yizabikisa mbutukulu yi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Zimi di Elizabeti bu dilungisa ngonda sambanu. Nzambi wufidisa mbazi Ngabileli ku mbanza mosi yi Ngalili yi bakwe tumisinanga ti Nazaleti, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />ku ndumba yimosi yi nkumbu Maliya yilembolo teka zaba babakala, yi bahaana nsilulu yi makwela ku bakala dimosi diba mu kanda di Davidi, nkumbu andi Yosefi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Mbazi yi yenda kota mu nzo andi na yi muteela ti: «Yangalala kwaku, ngeye tambudi mulemvo mpe Mfumu wu naku.» <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maliya wusunsumuka mu mpova bezozo na wukifuula mu zaba: Nkye mpila mbangudulu yi mbote beyoyo e? <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Kansi, mbazi yi muteela ti: «Maliya, kubandi na bunkuta ko, mu dyambu ti Nzambi wu kuyangaladi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Wuna baka zimi mpe wuna buta mwana wu bakala na wuna muhaana nkumbu yi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Wuna ba muntu wumfunu na bamutumisina Mwana wu Nzambi Yihyokidi Kuzangama. Mfumu Nzambi wuna muhaana kintinu ki tata andi Davidi, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />wuna yaala mvimba nzo yi Yakobi na kimfumu kyandi kyaaba na nsukunu ko.» <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Kansi Maliya wuteela mbazi ti: «Bwedi musamu bewuwu wulendi hidimina, mu dyambu ti naazebi babakala ko e?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Mbazi yi muvutudila ti: «Mpeve Yilongo yina kwiza ku ngeye na lulendo lu Nzambi luna kufuka bonso mposi. Ni hahoho, mwana bewowo wa butuka waaba wulongo, mbo bamutumisina Mwana Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Tala! Elizabeti mwisi kanda dyaku, yandi mpe weka na zimi mu bununu bwandi. Wuna buta mwana wu bakala. Mpeleko bedi mu tumisinanga ti kisita, kansi bwabu weka mu ngonda yi sambanu. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kunani musamu, Nzambi kalendi lembana.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Maliya wuvutula ti: «Meno kisadi ki Mfumu nidi, biika bu hilama mu meno bonso buwuntedidi!» Mboki Mbazi wuyenda kwandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maliya wuyenda tala Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mu bilumbu bilanda, Maliya wuyenda mu muswalu ku mbanza yimosi yi kizunga ki Yuda kii na milandu. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Bu katuula, wukota mu nzo yi Zakaliya na wuhaana Elizabeti mbote. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elizabeti bu katumbu yuwa mbote yi muhaana Maliya, mwana wu sunsumuka mu kyese mu moyo andi. Na Elizabeti wufuluka mu Mpeve Yilongo <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />na wukahula ti: «Mu bakento bamvimba, ngeye Nzambi kasakumuni, mwana wu naaku mu moyo wusakumunu mpe wudi! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Meno, nani nidi mwanki ngudi yi Mfumu ani kiza kantala e? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Mu dyambu ti, bu ntumbu yuwa mbote aku, mwana wu mu moyo ani wu sunsumukini mu kyese. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Kyese ku yandi kwikidi, mu dyambu ti misamu mimvimba mi muteedidi Mfumu, mya hilama.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunga wumasika wu Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Buna Maliya wuta ebu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Mwela ani wuna siika Mfumu,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />mpe mutima ani wufulukidi mu kyese</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:47">mu Nzambi, Muvuukisi ani,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />mu dyambu ti wumbambukidi moyo, meno kisadi kyandi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Ni hahoho, mbandu zimvimba zantumisinanga: mukento wu kyese,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />mu dyambu ti Nzambi yi Lulendo wumpidikidi misamu mingitukulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">nkumbu andi Yilongo yidi,<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />yandi wukwe lonkanga bumbote bwandi ku mbandu ka mbandu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">ku bamvimba bakwe muvuminanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Wusidi misamu mingitukulu mu kooko kwandi ku lulendo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">na wukumini bankwa mayama,<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />wukatudi zintinu ha byandu byawu bi kimfumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">na wuzangudi bantu bakuluka.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Yukutisi bantu bana nsatu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">kansi wuvutudi bamvwama moko mampamba.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Wusadisi kisadi kyandi Isaeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">wumulonkidi bumbote bwandi,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />bonso bu katoma sila nsilulu ku zinkaka zeto, mimvu ka mimvu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">ku Abalahami na nkuna andi.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maliya wuhyokisa ngonda zitatu ku nzo yi Elizabeti, mboki wuvutuka ku nzo andi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbutukulu yi Yoane Mbotiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ntangu yifweti buta Elizabeti bu yifwana, wubuta mwana wubakala. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Bakundi bandi na bisi kanda dyandi bu bayuwa ti Mfumu wumusididi bumbote bwandi, buna bayiza yangalala kintwadi nandi. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Mwana bu kalungisa bilumbu nana, bayiza muzengisa bubakala. Basaka muhaana nkumbu yi tata andi, Zakaliya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Kansi, ngudi andi wuvutula ti: «Kani! nkumbu andi Yoane.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Yawu bamuteela ti: «Mu kanda dyaku munani muntu wu na nkumbu beyiyi!» <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Ni hahoho balabikisa tata andi mu zaba nkye nkumbu katiidi mutumisina mwana. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakaliya wulomba ba mutwadila mwa baya, ni kasonika: «Nkumbu andi Yoane.» Mpe bamvimba bayituku. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Mboki, Zakaliya wutumbu tona dyaka muzonza na wusiika Nzambi mu ndinga yi ngolo. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Bantu bamvimba ba kitini bekyokyo bayena bunkuta, mpe mu kizunga kimvimba ki milandu mi Yuda bantu bamokina misamu bemyomyo. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Bamvimba bedi kwe yuwi myo, bakota mu mayindu, bedi kwe kiyuvudi: «Mwana bewuwu, nki kaba e? Kedika, kooko ku lulendo lu Mfumu luba nandi.»<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunga wu Zakaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakaliya, tata di mwana wufuluka mu Mpeve Yilongo na wutona mu bikula ebu:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Masiika ku Mfumu, Nzambi yi Isaeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">yandi wizi sadisa mukangu andi mpe kudidi wo.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Wutuheeni mumvuukisi wu lulendo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">mu kanda di Davidi, kisadi kyandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Bonso bu kasamuna myo mu ntama, mu munwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:70">wu mimbikudi myandi milongo:<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Mu tukuula mu moko ma mitantu myeto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">na bakwe tu belanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Ni hahoho, kalonkidi bumbote bwandi ku zinkaka zeto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">na kabambukidi moyo luwawanu lwandi lu longo.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Bonso, budi ndefi yi kadya ku nkaka eto Abalahami,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />mu tukuula mu moko ma mitantu myeto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">mwanki tumusadila kondo bunkuta,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />mu bulongo na mu ludedomo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">mu kizingu kyeto kimvimba.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Ngeye mwana ani, wuna ba mumbikudi wu Nzambi yi Zangama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">mu dyambu ti, wuna tekila ku mutwala wu Mfumu, mu mukubikila nzila,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />mu zabikisa ku mukangu andi ti yandi waabakuula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">bu kaabalemvokila masumu mawu.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi eto muntu wunkenda na wuluzolo kadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">yandi waakukyenzola mu kukya kwa fuma ku yulu kufwanani bonso ntangu yikwe tubukanga,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />mu kyenzola bantu badi mu kati dimpimpa na mu tombe ki lufwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">mpe mu tutwadisa mu nzila yi kiyenge.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana wedi kula na wedi baka ngolo zi kimpeve. Wuzinga ku nsi yinkatu natee kilumbu ki kayenda yenika ha meso ma bantu ba-Isaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mbutukulu yi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mu ntangu beyoyo, mfumu Kayisali Angustu wuhaana lutumu, mu zaba lutangu lu bantu bamvimba ba nsi zi mu luyaalu lwandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Lutangu belolo, lusalama, buna Kilinyuse wu mfumu mu kizunga ki Siliya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Bantu bamvimba bedi kwenda sonama, muntu-muntu ku yandi mbanza yi kabutukila. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosefi mpe wukatuka ku Nazaleti, mbanza yi kizunga ki Ngalili na wuyenda ku kizunga ki Yuda, ku mbanza yi nkumbu Betelemi, mu dyambu ti, wuba mwisi kanda di Davidi, <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />mwanki ka kisonikisa na Maliya, wu kasila nsilulu yi makwela, wuba na zimi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Buna bakidi ku Betelemi, ntangu yi Maliya ye buta yitula. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Maliya wubuta mwana wubakala, ni mwana andi wuntete. Wumuzinga mulele na wumulambikisa mu kati di kidikulu ki bibulu, mu dyambu ti babaka kibuka mu nzo yi banzenza ko.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbazi yiyenikina mimvungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Mu kizunga bekyokyo kwandi, kuba na mimvungi myedi kenganga mpimpa yimvimba bibulu byawu mu zimfuba. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Mbazi yi Mfumu yi bayenikina, mpe nkembo Mfumu wu lezima na wu bazungidila. Mboki, bayena bunkuta bubwingi. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Kansi mbazi yibateela ti: «Lubandi na bunkuta ko! Mu dyambu ti nalutwadidi musamu wumbote wa yangidika bantu babingi: <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />mu mpimpa beyiyi, ku mbanza Davidi, balubutidi Mumvukisi eno, ni Klisto, Mfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Mu kidimbu eki lwaamuzabila: Luna yena mwana wunsombe wuba zingidi mulele, mpe bamulambikisi mu kidikulu ki bibulu.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Bayitukulu kwawu, kamba di zimbazi diyiza bundana na mbazi yitekila nawu, bakembila Nzambi ebu:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Nkembo ku Nzambi mu mazulu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">ye kiyenge ha butoto ku bantu bazolakana.»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mimvungi miyenda ku Betelemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Zimbazi bu zisa basisa, zivutuka ku yulu na mimvungi mitelasana: «Twendeeno tii ku Betelemi mu tala nkye misamu mihyokidi kooko, misamu mitutedidi Mfumu.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Buna bayenda mu muswalu na bayenda yena Maliya, Yosefi na mwana wubalambikisa mu kidikulu ki bibulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Bu bayena mwana, bayala mpolo yi misamu mimvimba mi bateela mbazi mu dyambu di mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Bantu bamvimba bayuwa misamu mita mimvungi bayituku. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Maliya wulunda misamu bemyomyo mu mutima andi na wusosa muzaba mbangudulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Mboki mimvungi mivutuka. Bakembila na basiika Nzambi mu mimvimba mi bayuwa na mi bayena, mu dyambu ti mimvimba miyenda detila bonso bu bateela myo mbazi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bahaana mwana nkumbu yi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Mwana bu kalungisa bilumbu nana, bamuzenga bubakala bwandi na bamuhaana nkumbu yi Yesu, bonso ntumunu zi muheeka mbazi tekila ngudi andi kabaka zimi.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosefi na Maliya banata Yesu ku nzo-Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Bilumbu bye vedisa nitu bu bilunga, bonso budi musiku wu Mose, Yosefi na Maliya banata mwana ku Yelusalemi, mwanki bamulonka ha ntadisi yi Mfumu, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />bonso busonama mu Misiku mi Mfumu ti: «Wonso mwana wu bakala wa butuka wuntete wufweti ba mvwilu yi Mfumu.» <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Mboki, mu haana mpe minkayulu mi bakwe yokanga: «biduka byole hoti mabembe mole», bonso bu misonimina mu Misiku mi Mfumu.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Ku Yelusalemi, kuba na muntu wumosi, nkumbu andi Simeoni, wuba muntu wusungama mpe wedi vuminanga Nzambi. Wedi kingilanga muntu waakwiza kuula Isaeli. Mpeve Yilongo yiba nandi, <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />mpe yimuteela ti kaakifwila ko, tekila kayena Mesiya wuna fidisa Mfumu Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Mu ntwadusulu yi Mpeve Yilongo , Simeoni wuyenda ku nzo-Nzambi. Mu ntangu beyoyo, Yesu bamunata ku tata na ngudi andi, mwanki balungisa masonama mu Misiku mu dyambu dyandi. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeoni wubonga mwana mu moko mandi, wutonda Nzambi na wuta ebu:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />Mfumu, biika bwabu kisadi kyaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">kenda kavunda mu kiyenge, mu dyambu ti nsilulu zaku zi lungidi,<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />nyeni mpulusu mu mani meso,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />yi wutambikidi ku makanda mamvimba,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />kukya kwa sa ti makanda mamvimba ma mu nza ma kuzaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">mpe nkembo ku Isaeli, mukangu aku.<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbikululu yi Simeoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Tata andi na ngudi andi bayituku mu misamu bemyomyo myedi ta Simeoni mu dyambu di mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeoni wubasakumuna na wuteela Maliya, ngudi yi Yesu ti: «Tala, mwana bewuwu waabwisa, mpe waazangula babingi mu Isaeli. Wuna ba kidimbu ki Nzambi na kyaatwala nkabani ha kati di bantu, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />na nge bende, mbele yi mvita ya tobola mutima aku, mpe mansweki ma bantu babingi mazabakana.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana, mumbikudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kuba mpe mumbikudi wumosi wu mukento, nkumbu andi Ana, wuba mwana wu Fanueli mu kanda di Aseli. Wutoma nuna kumanima ma mvula nsambwadi zi kazakala na mulumi andi wedi mukwelanga, buna wakidi ndumba yilembolo zaba babakala, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />mboki wusaala foola, mpe wuzinga mvula makumi nana na ya. Kedi biika mu kwenda ku nzo-Nzambi ko, kansi wedi sadilanga Nzambi mpimpa na mwini mu minunu yi nsoki na lusambulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Yandi mpe wutula hoho ntangu beyoyo, wukembila Nzambi mpe wedi zonzila Yesu ku bantu bedi kingilanga nkululu yi Yelusalemi.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutukulu ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Tata andi na ngudi andi bu bamana lungisa masonama mu Misiku mi Mfumu, ni bavutuka ku Ngalili, ku mbanza yi Nazaleti. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana wukula na wubaka ngolo. Wufuluka mu ndwenga mpe lusakumunu lu Nzambi luba nandi.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu mvula kumi na zole, Yesu wuyenda ku nzo-Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kadi mumvu, tata na ngudi andi bedi kwendanga ku Yelusalemi ku munkembo wu Pake. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu bu kalungisa mvula kumi na zole, bayenda nandi, bonso buba kinkulu kyawu. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Mboki, mukembo bu wumanisa, ni bavutuka. Yesu wusaala ku Yelusalemi, kansi tata andi na ngudi andi bazaba ko. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bedi banza ti Yesu wuba na bahiika bazyeta nawu kintwadi. Badyata kilumbu kimvimba. Mboki batona mu kwe musosi ku bantu ba mu kanda dyawu na bakundi awu, <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />kansi bamuyena ko. Ni bavutuka ku Yelusalemi mu kwe musosi. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />kumanima ma bilumbu bitatu, bamuyena mu kati di nzo-Nzambi: wuzakala ha kati-kati di milongisi mi Misiku, wedi badimbanga mpe wedi baziikanga byuhu. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Bamvimba bedi mu yuwa bayituku mu madyela mandi mpe mu mvutu zi kedi vutulanga. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Mu ntangu, tata andi na ngudi andi bu bamuyena bayituku, mboki ngudi andi wumuteela ti: «Ha mwana ani! Kadi nki sididi bobo e? Taleeti, meno na tata aku tuna kwe kusaki na kinkunku!» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Wubavutudila ti: «Mu dyambu di nki lwena kwe nsakidi e? Yeno luzebi ko ti mfweti sadila tata ani e?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Kansi babakula misamu mi kedi bateela ko.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yesu wuvutuka nawu ku Nazaleti. Wedi batumiminanga. Ngudi andi wedi lundanga mimvimba ku nsye mutima andi. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu wukula na wuyiza ba na ndwenga zizingi. Mpe wedi yangidikanga Nzambi na bantu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ndongolo yi Yoane Mbotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mlk 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoa 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mu mvula yi kumi na tanu mu kimfumu ki ntinu Tibeli, buna Ponso Pilatu wuna yaala kizunga ki Yuda, Elode ku kizunga ki Ngalili, Filipi mpangi awu ku kizunga ki Ituli na ki Takonitite, mboki Lisania ku kizunga ki Abileni. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Mpe buna, Ana na Kayifa badi zimfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi, mambu ma Nzambi mayuwakana ku Yoane, mwana Zakaliya, ku nsi yinkatu. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yoane wuzyeta ku kizunga ki ba bela-bela na nzadi yi Yolodani na wubateela ebu: «Viluleeno madyela, mpe botameeno, mwanki Nzambi kalulemvokila masumu meno.»<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Bonso budi busonama mu buuku di mumbikudi Yesaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Ni ndinga yi muntu yina bokana ku nsi yinkatu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Kubikeeno nzila yi Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">mpe sungikeeno nzila zandi!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Mabenga mamvimba maafuluka mu butoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">milandu mimvimba na matenta mamvimba maabetomoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">nzila zitengama zaasungama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">nzila zimbi zaaba nalengo-lengo,<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />mpe bantu bamvimba baayena mpulusu yi fumini ku Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Bantu babingi bedi kwizanga ku Yoane mwanki ka babotika, ni kedi bateelanga ti: «Kanda di zimpidi! Nani wululwengisi mu tina nganzi zi Nzambi zeka bela-bela e? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Lonkeeno mimbutu mina lonka ti luviludi madyela, ka muta ko ti: “Abalahami, nkaka eto yidi!” Mu dyambu ti Nzambi lenda sa ti matadi bemama ma kituka baala ba Abalahami. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Bwabu kiibi kikubamani mu zenga miti mu myanzi: ni hahoho myonso miti mikwe lembolo butanga mbutu zimbote mya kwangu mpe mya tubu ku tiya.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Mukangu ni wumufuula ti: «Bwabu yeto nki tufweti sa e?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Wuvutula ti: «Wonso muntu wuna binkutu byole, bika kaheeka kimosi ku mu nandi lembolo kyo, mpe wonso wuna bindya kakabula ku yondowo lembolo ba na byo.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Bitoti bimpaku mpe bayiza mu botama, bafuula Yoane ti: «Mulongisi, yeto nki tufweti sa e?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Wubavutudila ti: «Lubwesandi mbongo ha yulu ntalu yimpaku yizenga luyaalu ko.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Bambulumbulu mpe bamufuula ti: «Hambo yeto, nki tufweti sa e?» Wubavutudila ti: «Luzikandi mbongo zi muntu ko, mpe luhuninandi muntu musamu ko, kansi sadileeno kwandi mufutu wu lukwe bakanga mu ngonda.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Mukangu bu wedi kingilanga Mesiya, bamvimba bedi kifulanga: «Kadi Yoane kaa ni Mesiya ko e?» <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Ni hahoho, Yoane kabateela ti: «Meno, nina lubotika mu mamba kansi kuna kwiza muntu wumvudidi lulendo. Niidi wulunga ko mu munyanguna misinga mi nsampatu zandi. Yandi, waalubotika mu Mpeve Yilongo na mu tiya. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Simbidi ha kooko kwandi muti we yengisila, mu hambisa mbutu zibele na bititi. Wuna yonzika mbutu zibele mu kati di kilundulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilundulu ki zimbutu ku yeto, tanda bakwe todila kyo</char></note> mpe wuna yoka bititi ku tiya tukwe lembolo zimanga.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yoane wusyamisa mukangu mu ndongolo zizingi. Na wubazabisa Musamu Wumbote. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Kansi Yoane wusemba ntinu Elode, wedi yaalanga kizunga ki Ngalili, mu dyambu di Elodiade, mukento wu mpangi andi Filipi, mpe mu misamu mihiika mimbi mi kahidika. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Elode wuhidika dyaka musamu wumbi, wutuula Yoane mu boloko.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbotokolo yi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Bu kamana botika bantu bamvimba, Yesu mpe wubotoko. Bu kedi sambila, yulu dizibuka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />mboki Mpeve Yilongo yikulumuka ku yandi mu lunitu lu kifwani ki bembe. Ndinga yiyuwakana tuuka ku yulu: «Ngeye ni mwana ani wunkwe toma tyanga, kyese kyani kimvimba mu ngeye kidi.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ki ni kinkulu ki kanda di Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu bu katona kisalu kyandi, kampe buna wu na mvula makumatatu. Bantu babanza ti wuba mwana wu Yosefi, Yosefi wuba mwana Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli mwana Matati, Matati mwana Levi, Levi mwana Meleki, Meleki mwana Yanayi, Yanayi mwana Yosefi, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosefi mwana Matatyase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Matatyase mwana Amosi, Amosi mwana Nahumi, Nahumi mwana Heseli, Heseli mwana Nangayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nangayi mwana Mahati, Mahati mwana Matatyase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Matatyase mwana Semeyeni, Semeyeni mwana Yoseki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Yoseki mwana Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda mwana Yoanani, Yoanani mwana Lesa, Lesa mwana Zolobabeli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Zolobabeli mwana Salatieli, Salatieli mwana Neli. <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neli mwana Meleki, Meleki mwana Adi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Adi mwana Kosami, Kosami mwana Elemadami. Elemadami mwana Edi, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Edi mwana Yesu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Yesu mwana Eliyezeli, Eliyezeli mwana Yolime, Yolime mwana Matati, Matati mwana Levi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Levi mwana Simeoni, Simeoni mwana Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yuda mwana Yosefi, Yosefi mwana Yonami, Yonami mwana Eliakime, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakime mwana Meleya, Meleya mwana Mena, Mena mwana Matata, Matata mwana Natani na Natani mwana Davidi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Davidi mwana Yese, Yese mwana Obedi, Obedi mwana Bozi, Bozi mwana Sala, Sala mwana Nasoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nasoni mwana Aminadabi, Aminadabi mwana Adimini, Adimini mwana Alani, Alani mwana Heselomi, Heselomi mwana Falesi, Falesi mwana Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda mwana Yakobi, Yakobi mwana Isaaki, Isaaki mwana Abalahami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Abalahami mwana Tela, mpe Tela mwana Naholi, Naholi mwana Saluki, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Saluki mwana Lango, Lango mwana Faleki, Faleki mwana Ebeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Ebeli mwana Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala mwana Kayinami, Kayinami mwana Alefasadi, Alefasadi mwana Semi, Semi mwana Nowa, Nowa mwana Lameki. <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki mwana Matusalemi, Matusalemi mwana Henoki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Henoki mwana Yaleti, Yaleti mwana Maleleli, Maleleli mwana Kayinami, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kayinami mwana Enosi, Enosi mwana Seti, Seti mwana Adami, Adami mwana Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nkadyampempa wutonta Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu wufuluka mu Mpeve Yilongo, wusisa nzadi yi Yolodani na wuyenda ku nsi yinkatu mu lutwadusu lu Mpeve. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Nkadyampemba wumutonta koko mu bilumbu makumaya (40). Mu bilumbu bebyobyo, Yesu kadya kima ko. Ku manima, wuyena nsatu. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Hahoho, Nkadyampemba ka muteela ti: «Tala ti ngeye Mwana Nzambi wudi, tuma ku tadi bedidi di kituka dimpa.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Basonika: Luzingu lu muntu luu kaka mu dimpa ko.»<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Nkadyampemba wumunata ha yulu mulandu na wumulonkisa bimfumu bimvimba bi nza mu nkumbu mosi, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />na wumuteela ti: Nina kuhaana lulendo na bimvwama bimvimba bi kimfumu bekiki: mu dyambu ti meno bahaana byo, mpe ndendi byeheeka ku wonso muntu wu ntiidi. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Tala ti wumfukimini, bimvimba byaaba byaku. <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Wusonama: Mfumu Nzambi aku kaka fweti fukimina, mpe Yandi kaka fweti sadila.»<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Nkadyampemba wubwesa munata dyaka ku Yelusalemi, wumutuula ha nsongi yi nzo-Nzambi na wumuteela ti: «Tala ti Mwana Nzambi wudi, wukituba ku nsi, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />mu dyambu ti basonika: “Nzambi waahaana mu dyambu dyaku ntumunu ku zimbazi zandi zi kukeba”, <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />mpe dyaka: “Baakuyaka mu moko mawu, mwanki kuulu kwaku kulembolo koyama ha tadi.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Basonika: “Wulendi tonta Mfumu Nzambi aku ko.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Nkadyampemba bu kamanisa mu tonta Yesu, wusa musisa natee mu hwahwa dihiika.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutona kisalu kyandi ku Ngalili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu wuvutuka ku Ngalili wuba wufuluka na lulendo lu Mpeve Yilongo. Kikumu kyandi kimwangana mu kizunga kimvimba. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Wedi kwe longingi mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo mpe bantu bamvimba bedi mu musiika.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ba mubisa ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu wuyenda ku mbanza Nazaleti ku kakudila. Kilumbu ki saba, wukota mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo bonso bu ba kifu kyandi. Wutelama mu tanga Masonama <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Bamuhaana buuku di mumbikudi Yesaya. Wuzingumuna dyo na wutanga mambu ma ba basonika ebu:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Mpeve yi Mfumu yi mu meno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">mu dyambu ti wunsoodidi mu mwangisa musamu wumbote ku bamputu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Wuntambikidi mu zabikisa nkululu ku bantu baa mu kinkole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">mu zibula meso ku bampofo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">na mu haana kimpwanza ku bantu baa mu mfyetokoso,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />mu samuna mumvu wumbote wu Mfumu, wu kaa lonka bumbote bwandi.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ku manima, wuzinga buuku, wuvutula dyo ku kisadi, mboki wuzakala. Bamvimba baba mu kati di nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo bamusungimina. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Hahoho katona mu bateela ti: «Bubedidi, Masonama ma luyudi, menzi detila.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bamvimba bamusiika, bayituku mu mpova zimbote zedi totoka mu munwa andi na bata ti: Wuwu kaa mwana Yosefi ko? <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Kampe lwaanteela kingana eki: “Ngwe kibuki, buka nitu aku ngebende.” Mpe mbo lunteela dyaka ti: “mimvimba mi tuyudi, mi wusidi ku Kapenawumi, hidika myo mpe mu nsi aku.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Wubwesa bateela dyaka ti: «Kedika nina luteela: mumbikudi katambulungu bumbote mu nsi andi ko. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Kedika nina luteela: mu ntangu yiba mumbikudi Eliya, mu mimvu mitatu na ngonda sambanu mvula zinooka dyaka ko, malema mangolo mabwa mu nsi yimvimba. Mafoola mamingi maba ku Isaeli, <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />kansi, bafidisa Eliya ku mafoola bemomo ko. Ku foola dimosi kwandi diba ku mbanza Salepita, ku nsi yi Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Mu ntangu yi mumbikudi Elize, bantu babingi babeela bwazi ku Isaeli, kaa wumosi mu yawu wunyaka ko, kansi Naamani kwandi mwisi Siliya wunyaka.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bantu bamvimba baba mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, bafuluka mu mankesi bu bayuwa misamu bemyomyo. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Batelama, bamukuma ha mbanza mpe bamunata natee ha yulu mulandu wutungulu mbanza awu mwanki bamununguna ku benga. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Kansi Yesu wuhyokila ha kati dyawu, mboki wuyenda kwandi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa muntu wuba na mpeve yimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mlk 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Yesu wukulumuka ku mbanza yi Kapenawumi, mbanza yi kizunga ki Ngalili, wedi longanga bantu kilumbu ki saba. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Bantu bayituku mu ndongosolo andi mu dyambu ti wedi longilanga mu lulendo. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, muba na bakala dimosi diba na mpeve yimbi. Wulooka mu ngolo ti: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Ha! Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti, nkye dyambu ngeye na yeto e? Wizidi mu kwiza tufukisa e? Nzebi ngeye nani wudi: Wulongo, Nzambi wu katambikidi!» <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu wumubamina na wumuteela ti: «Kanga munwa aku, duuka mu nitu yi bakala bedyodyo!» Mpeve yimbi yilosa ha nsi bakala bedyodyo ha kati di bundu di bantu na yiduuka mu yandi, ka musa bubi ko. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Bantu bamvimba batoma yituku na bafulasana yawu na yawu ti: «Nkye mutindu mpova zi e? Wuna tuma mpeve zimbi mu ngolo na mu lulendo na zina duuka!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Buna kikuumu ki Yesu kimwangana ku ndambu ka ndambu mu kizunga bekyokyo.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa zimbevo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Bu kaduuka mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, wuyenda ku nzo yi Simoni. Buko bu Simoni wuba na yuku-yuku dingolo na balomba ku Yesu ka munyakisa. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu wuyinama ha ba mbevo, wubamina yuku-yuku, mboki yuku-yuku diduuka. Buko wutumbu telama na wutona mu bakubikila meza.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ntangu bu yidyama, bamvimba baba na zimbevo ziba na mayeela ma mumpila mumpila, babanata ku Yesu. Wutentika moko ku kadi mbevo na wu banyakisa. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Mpeve zimbi ziduuka mu bantu babingi ni zedi kwe looki ti: «Ngeye Mwana Nzambi wudi.» Kansi wubabamina na kedi bahaana luve lwe zonzila ko, mu dyambu ti bazaba ti Yandi ni Klisto.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wulonga ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mlk 1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Bwisi bu bukya, wuduuka na wuyenda ha kibuka ki yandi hiika. Mpumbu zi bantu zedi kwe musosi na ziyenda natee ha kaba. Batya mu mudika mu kwenda mwanki kalembolo basisa. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Kansi wubateela ti: «Mfweti kwenda mwangisa mpe musamu wumbote wu Kimfumu ki Nzambi ku mbanza zihiika, dyambu dyadyodyo Nzambi ka mfidisidi.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Wedi kwe longingi ku Yuda mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Milongoki mintete mi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Kilumbu kimosi, Yesu wuba ha kumu di dyanga di Ngenezaleti, mpumbu yi bantu yiyiza fyetakana ha kaba mu yuwa mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Wuyena ha kumu di dyanga milungu myole mi bilobi, bitotoka mu sukula mpwasa zawu. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Wukota mu mulungu wumosi wuba wu Simoni, na wulomba baba mwa kitatu na kumu. Mboki wuzakala mu mulungu na wutona mu longa mpumbu yi bantu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Bu kamanisa mu zonza, wuteela Simoni: «Yenda ha mamba maa sunda mboki loosa mpwasa mu loba.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni wumuvutudila ti: «Mulongisi, mpimpa yimvimba tu lobidi, tubeki kaani kima ko. Kansi mu luzolo lwaku, nina loosa zimpwasa.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Bu balosa zo, babaka mbizi zizingi na zimpwasa zitona mu kaakuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Balabikisa banawu baba mu mulungu wuhiika biza ba babakisa. Bu bayiza, batebola milungu mya mimyole, na mitona mu dyama. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Bu kayena bobo, Simoni Petelo wufukama ha ntadisi yi Yesu na wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, ntatukila, mu dyambu ti meno nkwa masumu nidi!» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Bamvimba baba nandi kintwadi, bayena bunkuta mu dyambu di mbizi zizingi zi babaka. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Zaki na Yoane, baala ba Zebedayi baba kintwadi na Simoni bayena mpe bunkuta. Yesu wuteela Simoni ti: «Kuyenandi bunkuta ko, bwabu wuna ba kilobi ki bantu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Bavutula milungu ha kumu, mboki basala sisa bimvimba na bamulanda.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa muntu wuba na bwazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yesu wuba mu kati di mbanza yimosi, wuyena bakala dimosi diba na bwazi. Bu kayena Yesu, wumufukimina luse ha nsi, na wulomba ebu: «Mfumu, tala ti tiidi, wulendi mvedisa.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu wulambula kooko, wumusimba na wuta ti: «Ntiidi, biika wuvedila.» Mboki bwazi butumbu manisa. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu, wumukanikina muta wo ku muntu. Kansi, wumuteela kenda kayenika ku Nganga-nzambi mwanki wumuhaana munkayulu wu mvutululu yi matondo mu mvedosolo aku, bonso busonika Mose. Bwabobo bantu bamvimba baazabila ti nyeki. <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Kikumu kyandi kivula mwangana dyaka na mpumbu zi bantu zedi kwiza kutakananga mu muyuwa na mu sosa lunyakusu lu bimbevo byawu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Kansi, Yesu wedi basisanga, mu kwenda ku bibuka bilembolo ba bantu mu sambila.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa muntu wubela mbolokoto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Kilumbu kimosi, Yesu wedi longanga. Bafalisi na milongisi mi Misiku baba hoho, bafuma ku mabwala mamvimba ma Ngalili, ma Yuda, na ku Yelusalemi. Lulendo lu Mfumu luba mu Yesu, ni kedi kwe nyakisi zimbevo. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Babakala bedi kwe twadi mu kipoyi bakala dimosi diba na kimbevo ki mbolokoto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mbolokoto </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bahiika bakwe ta ti mbwonzongolo </char></note>, basosa bwedi balendi mu kotisila na mu mutuula ha ntadisi yi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Bu bedi lembolo zaba bwedi mu mukotisila mu dyambu di mpumbu yi bantu, bamaka ku yulu muludi na batobola wo. Ni bamukulumuna mu kipoyi ha mpwakisa beyoyo, ha kati di bantu, ha ntadisi yi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Bu kayena kiminu kyawu, Yesu wuta ku mbevo ti: «Masumu maku ma lemvokolo.» <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Milongisi mi Misiku na Bafalisi batona mu nyunguta: Yandi nani kadi, wuna safula<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Safula </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bonso Kusamvula </char></note> Nzambi? Nani wuhiika lenda lemvokila masumu tala ti ka Nzambi yandi bende ko e? <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu wuzaba mabanza mawu ni kabateela ti: «Bila nki luna banzila bobo e? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Nkye dyambu dilutidi nayakiyaki mu ta ti: “Masumu maku malemvokolo” hoti “Telama na yenda e?” <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Mwanki luzaba ti: Mwana Muntu wuna lulendo lwe lemvokila masumu ha luse lu butoto» Buna wuteela muntu wuba na mbolokoto ti: «Telama, bonga kipoyi kyaku na vutuka ku nzo aku.» <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Muntu bewowo ka tumbu telama, ha ntadisi yi bamvimba, wubonga kipoyi kyandi na wuvutuka ku nzo andi na wedi kwe kembidi Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Bamvimba bayituku na bakembila Nzambi, bayena bunkuta, ni bata ti: «Kilumbu ki bubedidi, misamu mingitukulu tuyeni!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbokolo yi Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mlk 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ku manima, Yesu wuduuka na wuyena mutoti mpaku wumosi, nkumbu andi Levi, wuzakala ha kibuka kyandi ki kisalu. Wumuteela ti: «Ndanda». <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Levi ni ka sa bwongola bimvimba, wutelama na wumulanda. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Levi wumukubikila ndambisa yiyinene ku nzo andi, mitoti mimpaku mimingi na bantu bahiika baba nawu kintwadi ha meza. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Bafalisi na milongisi mi Misiku bavunguta na bateela milongoki mi Yesu ti: bila nki luna diila na nwiina ha kimosi na mitoti mimpaku na ba nkwa masumu e? <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Ka bantu ba muhinya ko ba na nsatu yi mumbuki, kansi ni bambevo. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Nayizidi mu tumisa bantu balunungu ko, kansi minsumuki.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndongolo yi Yesu mu minunu yi nsoki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bafalisi bamuteela ti: «Ntangu zizingi, milongoki mi Yoane na mi Bafalisi, bakwe minanga nsoki bubwingi mpe bakwe sambilanga, kansi milongoki myaku, kisalu kyawu kudya na kunwa». <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Bwedi lulenda dikila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dikila </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kudika, interdire, à ne pas confondre avec Kudikila, faire manger</char></note> bakundi ba kikwedi mu dya na mu nwa, mu ntangu yi baakidi nandi kintwadi e? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Kansi, mu bilumbu bina kwiza, baabonga kikwedi ha kati dyawu, mbo bamina nsoki mu bilumbu bebyobyo.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Wubateela dyaka kingana eki: «Kunaani muntu lenda kakuna kitende mu kinkutu kimona mu londa kintama, mu dyambu ti kinkutu kimona kyaakyakuka. Mpe kitende kimona kilendi fwanakana na ki ntama ko. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Kunani mpe muntu wulenda tuula malamu mansonso mu mitumbu mintama, mu dyambu ti malamu mansonso malenda bula mitumbu, kumanima malamu mamwangana ha nsi mpe mitumbu mya hombila. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Kansi, bufweni mu tuula malamu mansonso mu mitumbu mimona. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Mpe kunaani muntu, bu kanwini malamu ma mfiku, kabwesa nwa dyaka mansonso, mu dyambu ti mbo kata ti: “Mfiku yivudidi luhu.”»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na kilumbu ki saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Mu kilumbu ki saba, Yesu wuhyokila mu mfuba zibele. Milongoki myandi myedi kwe hedi mbutu zibele, bedi kwe zokoni zo mu moko mawu, ni bedi kwe dye zo. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mwa kabu di Bafalisi bata ti: «Bila nki luna hiidikila misamu mi bakanikina kilumbu ki saba e?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Lutanga ko misamu mihidika Davidi bu kaba na nsatu, yandi mpe na bantu baba nandi kintwadi e? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Wukota mu nzo-Nzambi, wubonga mampa ma minkayulu, wudya mo na wuhaana mo ku bantu baba nandi kintwadi, mpeleko zinganga-Nzambi kwandi ba na luve lwe dya mo.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «Mwana Muntu wudi Mfumu yi saba.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa bakala diba na kooko kusyoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Kilumbu kihiika ki saba, Yesu wukota mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo mu longa. Muba na bakala dimosi diba na kooko ku mimbakala kusyoka. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Milongisi mi Misiku na Bafalisi bedi mulanganga, mu tala kana waanyakisa mu kilumbu ki saba, mwanki ba baka kibila kiba mufundila. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Kansi, Yesu wuzaba mabanza mawu na wuteela ku bakala diba na kooko kusyoka ti: «Yiza telama, ha kati di bundu.» Wuyiza telama ha kati dyawu. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Mboki Yesu wubafuula ti: «Ntiidi mu zaba nki bifwanakani mu hidika mu kilumbu ki saba e? Musamu wumbote hoti musamu wumbi e? Kuvuukisa muntu hoti kumuhombisa e?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Bu kasungimina bamvimba, wuta ku bakala ti: «Lambula kooko kwaku.» Ni kalambula ko, mboki kooko kwandi ku beloka. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Mankesi ma bahyoka kitezo, bayuwasana yawu na yawu mu zaba nki balenda mu sa.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusoola zintumwa kumi na zole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Mu bilumbu bebyobyo, Yesu wutomboka ku yulu mulandu. Wusambila Nzambi mpimpa yimvimba. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Bwisi bu bukya, wutumisa milongoki myandi na wusoola kumi na bole, ba kaahaana nkumbu yi zintumwa: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni, wukahaana nkumbu yi Petelo na Andele mpangi andi, Zaki, Yoane, Filipi, Batelemi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayi, Toma, Zaki mwana wu Alefe, Simoni mu-Zeloti, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda mwana wu Zaki na Yuda Isikalyoti waamuyekola.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wulonga mpumbu yi bantu na wunyakisa zimbevo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Wukulumuka nawu na wuyenda telama ha nsuku, haba mpumbu yiyinene yi milongoki myandi na mpumbu yi bantu yifuma ku kizunga kimvimba ki Yuda, ku Yelusalemi na kizunga ki mubu kidi belabela na mbanza yi Tile na yi Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Bayiza mu muyuwa na mu nyakusu bimbevo byawu. Bantu bedi kwamusu ku mpeve zimbi, banyaka. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Bantu bamvimba bedi sosa mu musimba, mu dyambu ti lulendo lwedi duuka mu yandi, lwedi nyakisa bamvimba.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyese na kyadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu bu katala milongoki myandi, wuta ti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:20">«Kyese ku yeno bawelo, mu dyambu ti kimfumu ki Nzambi kyeno kidi!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Kyese ku yeno luna nsatu bubedidi, mu dyambu ti mbo luyukuta! Kyese ku yeno luna dila, mu dyambu ti mbo luseha.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Kyese ku yeno bu baa lubela, bu baa lukuma, bu baa lutuka na bu baa vweza nkumbu eno, mu dyambu di Mwana Muntu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Yangalaleeno mu kilumbu bekyokyo na duzumukeeno mu kyese, mu dyambu ti musendo eno waaba wuwunene ku yulu. Bwabobo mpe matata mawu bedi zominanga mimbikudi.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Kansi, kyadi ku yeno bamvwama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">mu dyambu ti lubeki bwabu mbombolo eno!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Kyadi ku yeno bwabu lumeni yukuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">mu dyambu ti mbo luyena nsatu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Kyadi ku yeno luna seha bwabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">mu dyambu ti lwaakota mu kifwidi na lwaadila!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Kyadi ku yeno bu baa lusiika ku bantu bamvimba, mu dyambu ti ni bwabobo mpe matata mawu bedi sanga ku mimbikudi mi luvunu!<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luzolo mu mitantu myeno</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7.12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Kansi, nina luteela yeno luna nyuwa na luteedidi ti: zoleeno mitantu myeno, hidikeeno misamu mimbote ku bana lubela, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />sakumuneeno bana lusinga, sambidileeno bana luyenisa mpasi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Tala ti muntu wukubendi mbata ha bundi dimosi, mutambila mpe dihiika, tala ti muntu wukubongidi kiyunga kyaku, bika kabonga mpe kinkutu kyaku. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Haana ku yondowo wu kulombidi kima, tala ti muntu bongidi kima kyaku, mubwongodila kyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Myo mi lutiidi ti bantu bahiika ba luhiidikila, yeno mpe bahidikileeno myo. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Ti lutiidi kwandi bakwe lutyanga, nkye ndandu lwaabaka e? Minsumuki mpe mikwe tyanga babatiidi. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Tala ti lukwe hidikanga misamu mimbote ku bakwe luhiidikilanga myo, nkye ndandu lwaabaka e? Baminsumuki mpe bobo kwandi bakwe saanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Tala ti ludefisi ku balenda luvutudila, nkye ndandu kwandi lwaabakila hoho e? Minsumuki mpe ba kwe defisanga ku baminsumuki, mwanki batambula kumanima mufutu wo kwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Kansi zoleeno mitantu myeno, hidikeeno misamu mimbote na defiseeno wulembolo ntentoko. Buna musendo eno waaba wuwunene, mboki balutumisina baala ba Nzambi yi zangama, mu dyambu ti Yandi wumbote kadi ku bantu bakwe lembolo mu vutudilanga matondo na ba na mutima wumbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Beno bantu ba nkenda bonso Tata eno.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufundisandi bahiika ko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Lufundisandi ko na lwaafundusu ko, luhaanandi nzengolo ko na lwaabaka nzengolo ko, lemvokileeno na mbo lulemvokolo. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Kabuleeno na mbo baalukabudila: mbo bafulusa mu posi di kinkutu kyeno ndambu yimbote, yi batoma ningisa, koma, mboki dyatoma fuluka na kusampa, mu dyambu ti kitezo ki lukwe tezilanga, kyakyokyo mpe baalutezila.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Wubateela dyaka kingana eki: «Mpofo lenda nata munandi mpofo e? Nganunu ya babole ba bwa mu bulu ko e? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Mulongoki kalendi hyoka mfumu andi ko, kansi mulongoki wutomini longoka, mbo kaaba bonso mfumu andi. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Mu dyambu di nki wuna yenina kititi kii mu diisu di mpangi aku, kansi wuna yena kibuku kibaya kii mu diisu dyaku ko e? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Bwedi lenda teela ku mpangi aku ti: “Bika na katula kititi kii mu diisu dyaku”, ngeye wuna lembana mu yena kibuku kibaya kii mu diisu dyaku e? Ngeye muntu wu diisu ku nsye lukaya wudi! Katula ntete kibuku kibaya kii mu diisu dyaku, mboki mbo wuyena bwedi lenda katudila kititi kii mu diisu di mpangi aku.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kadi muti na mbutu zandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Kunani muti wumbote wukwe butanga mbutu zimbi, na muti wumbi wukwe butanga mbutu zimbote. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Mu dyambu ti kadi muti wukwe zabulungu mu mbutu zandi. Bakwe helanga mbutu zi fike mu muti wu nsende ko mpe bakwe helanga mbutu zi muti wu vinu mu minkanga ko. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Muntu wumbote, kwe duukisanga misamu mimbote mu dyambu ti mutima andi wumbote wudi, kansi muntu wumbi kwe duukisanga misamu mimbi mu dyambu ti mutima andi wumbi wudi. Mu dyambu ti makwe duukanga ha munwa, mamomo mafulukidi mu mutima andi.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzo zole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Mu dyambu di nki lukwe ntumisinanga ti “Mfumu! Mfumu!”, Na lusadilanga eno ko ma nakwe luteelanga? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Biika na lulonka kifwani ki muntu wuna kwiza ku meno, kwe yuwanga malongi mani na kwe sadilanga mo. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Yandi fwanakani ku bakala dimosi, wu tunga nzo, wutoma haka butoto, mboki wutunga lufulu ha yulu matadi. mbukila yi yiza, nkuka yibwa mu nzo beyoyo, kansi kabwisa yoko, mu dyambu ti yiba yitungu bumbote. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Kansi muntu wukwe yuwanga na kwe lembolo sadilanga mo, fwanakani bonso muntu tungidi nzo ha yulu butoto, wulembolo haka lufulu. Nkuka yibwidi mu nzo, na nzo yibwidi mpe yitumbu bwonzomoka.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa mundongo wu mfumu yi bambulumbulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu bu kamana zonza misamu mimvimba ku mukangu wu muzungidila, wuyenda ku mbanza Kapenawumi. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Kuba na mfumu yimosi yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama, wuba na mundongo wumosi wu katoma tya bubwingi. Mundongo bewowo wuba na kimbevo na wuba lukufi mufwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Bu kayuwa kikumu ki Yesu, wutambika mwa ndambu bantu mu kati di zimbuta zi Bayudayo, mwanki ba mulomba kiza kanyakisa mundongo andi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Bu batula ha ntadisi yi Yesu, bamubombidila bubwingi ni bamuteela ti: «Muntu bewowo fwanakani wu musadisa. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Mu dyambu ti, tiidi nsi eto, mboki yandi wututungidi nzo yi lusambulu.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu wuyenda nawu. Kansi bu kaba bela-bela na nzo yi mfumu yi zimbulumbulu nkama, muntu bewowo wutambika zinkayi zandi mu teela Yesu ti: «Mfumu kukikwamisandi ko, mu dyambu ti niidi wulunga ko ti wukota mu nzo ani. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ni hahoho nyenini ti, ni wulunga ko mu kwiza meno bende ha ntadisi aku. Kansi ta kwandi mpova yimosi, kisadi kyani kyaanyaka. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Mu dyambu ti meno bende nii ku nsye lutumu lu zimfumu zani zi luyalu, mpe nii na zimbulu-mbulu ku nsye lutumu lwani. Ni namana ta ku wumosi: “Yenda!”, waakwenda, ni namana ta ku wuhiika: “Yiza!”, waakwiza, mpe namana ta ku mundongo ani: “sala kisalu eki!”, kyaakasala.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu bu kayuwa misamu bemyomyo, wuyituku na wubangumuka ku bantu bedi kwe mulandingi na wubateela ti: «Kedika mu kati di bantu ba-Isaeli nayeni kiminu ki mutindu bewuwu ko.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Bantu batambika mfumu yi bambulumbulu bu bavutuka ku nzo andi, bayenda bwana mundongo bewowo wunyaka.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wufulukisa mwana wufoola di Nayini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ku manima, Yesu wuyenda ku mbanza yi Nayini, milongoki myandi na kamba di bantu bayenda nandi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Bu batula ha mwelo wu mbanza, bayena bantu bedi kwenda ku ndyamu: wuba mwana wubakala wakwa wumosi wufoola dimosi, bisi mbanza beyoyo babingi bamulanda. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Mfumu bu kamuyena, wumufwila kyadi na wumuteela ti: «Kudilandi ko!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Mboki Yesu wufinama na wusimba kesi, bedi kwe nati kesi batelama. Yesu wuta: «Nge Toko, nina kutuma, vumbuka!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Muntu wuba wufwa wuzakala na wutona mu zonza. Yesu wumuvutula ku ngudi andi. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bantu bamvimba bayena bunkuta na bakembila Nzambi, mboki bata ti: «Mumbikudi wuwunene wutotokidi ha kati-kati dyeto! Nzambi wizi sadisa bantu bandi!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Nsangu zimwangana mu kizunga kimvimba ki Yuda na mu bizunga bi muzungidila mu myo mihidika Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoane Mbotiki fidisi milongoki myandi ku Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Milongoki miyadila mfumu awu Yoane mpolo mu mimvimba myedi hyoka. Na Yoane wutumisa milongoki myole ha kati dyawu <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />na wubafidisa ku Mfumu mu mufuula ti: «Ngeye ni muntu bewowo waakwiza hoti tufweti kingila wuhiika e?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Milongoki mi Yoane bu batula ku bela Yesu, bamuteela ti: «Yoane Mbotiki wututambikidi ku ngeye mu kufuula ti: “Ngeye ni muntu bewowo waakwiza hoti tufweti kingila wuhiika e?”» <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Mu ntangu beyoyo kwandi, Yesu wunyakisa bantu babingi mu bimbemvo, na byeta na wuduukisa mpeve zimbi na wuzibula meso ma zimpofo zizingi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Na wubahaana mvutu ti: «Yendeeno luyala mpolo ku Yoane mu mimvimba mi luyeni na mi luyudi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:22">zimpofo zena yena, bana byeta mu malu bana dyata bumbote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:22">banga bwazi bana vedoso, bafwa makutu bana yuwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:22">bafwa bana fuluka, na Musamu Wumbote wa bana samuna ku bamputu.<verse eid="LUK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Kyese ku muntu bewowo walembolo bika mu sa kiminu kyandi mu meno!»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Bantu bafidisa Yoane bu bavutuka, Yesu wutona mu zonzila Yoane ku bamvimba baba nandi kintwadi na wubafuula ti: «Nani luyenda tala ku nsi yinkatu e? Dyadya dyedi ningusu ku mupepe e? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Buna, nani kwandi luyenda tala e? Muntu wuba wulwata binkutu bi ntoko e? Kansi bantu bakwe lwaatanga binkutu bimbote ni yabobo bakwe zinganga mu kimvwama mu zinzo zi zintinu. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Kadi nani kwandi luyenda yena ku nsi yinkatu e? Mumbikudi e? Ninga, meno nina luteela ti, yandi hyokididi mumbikudi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Mu dyambu ti Yoane wudi wumosi mu masonama mana teela ebu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“Nina tambika ntumwa ani ku mutwala aku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">mu ku kubikila <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kutanga mpe mu Luka 1:16-17</char></note>nzila.”<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Kedika nina luteela, mu bantu bamvimba ba ha nza, kunaani muntu wu hyokidi Yoane mu mfunu. Kansi, wuvudi bukeke mu Kimfumu ki Nzambi, yandi wumuvudidi bunene. <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Bantu bamvimba na bitoti bimpaku bedi muyuwanga, babakula ti Nzambi wu lunungu kadi, Yoane ni kamana babotika. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Kansi Bafalisi na Milongisi mi Misiku babisa kwawu mambu ma bazodisila Nzambi na babisa kwawu ti Yoane ka babotika.»<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «Na banani ndendi fwanikisa bantu ba mbandu beyiyi e? Ku banani bafwanakani e? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bafwanakani na baala bafyoti bazakadi ha kibuka kikwe vukananga bantu bamvimba, mboki kutelasana yawu na yawu ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">“Yeto bu tusikidi hungu, kansi yeno lukinini ko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Yeto bu tuyimbidi mikunga mi kyadi, kansi yeno ludididi ko!”<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Mu dyambu ti Yoane bu kayiza, kedi dyanga mampa ko, mpe kedi nwanga vinu ko, kansi yeno luna ta ti: “Mpeve yimbi yi nandi!” <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwana Muntu wizidi, wuna dya mpe wuna nwa, kansi luna ta ti: “Taleno kweno muntu bewuwu, kisalu kyandi ku dya na ku nwa, nkayi zandi ni mitoti mimpaku na minsumuki!” <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Kansi ndwenga zi Nzambi zikwe yenikanga zi lunungu ku yobobo bakwe mutambulanga.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku nzo yi Mufalisi wu nkumbu Simoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mufalisi wumosi wutumisa Yesu mu dya kintwadi nandi. Yesu wukota mu nzo yi muntu bewowo na wuzakala ha meza. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Mu mbanza beyoyo muba na mukento wumosi wuba munsumuki. Bu kayuwa ti Yesu ha meza kadi mu nzo yi Mufalisi, wutwala mbwata yi alabati yifuluka mu mananasi, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />na wuyenda ba kumanima ma Yesu, ha ndambu bitambi byandi. Wudila na wubodisa bitambi bi Yesu mu mansangasa mandi, mboki wukusuna byo mu milengi myandi na wufiba byo mpe wukusa byo mananasi. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Mufalisi bewowo wutumisa Yesu mu dya, bu kayena bobo, wuta ku nsye mutima andi ti: «Tala ti muntu bewuwu mumbikudi kadi, nganunu keti zaba nani wudi mukento bewowo wuna kwe musimbi, munsumuki wunani wudi.» <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Buna Yesu wumuteela ti: «Simoni, musamu ntiidi mu kuteela.» Simoni wuvutula ti: «Zonza kwaku Mulongisi.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Bantu bole baba na mfuka ku kidefisi ki mbongo. Wumosi, wudefa nkama tanu zimbongo zi bisengo, wuhiika makumatanu ma mbongo zi bisengo. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Bu balembolo ba na mbongo ze mufuta, wubayambudila mfuka zawu ya babole. Buna nani mu ya babole, wavula mutya e?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni wuvutula ti: «Mu mayindu mani, ni muntu bewowo wukayambudila mfuka yihyokidi kitezo.» Yesu wumuteela ti: «Bumbote zonzidi.» <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Mboki, wubangumuka ku mukento na wuteela Simoni ti: «Yeni mukento bewuwu e? Meno nkotidi mu nzo aku, wumpeeni mamba me sukudila malu ko, kansi yandi nsukudi malu mu mansangasa mandi na nkusuni mo mu milengi myandi.<verse eid="LUK 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ngeye wumfibidi ko, kansi, yandi buna kakotidingi mumu, kabiikidi ko mu kwe fibi malu mani. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ngeye wunkusidi mananasi ku mutu ani ko, kansi, yandi nkusidi mananasi mu malu mani. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Ni hahoho, nina luteela ti, yandi tambudi ndemvokolo yi masumu mandi mamingi, mu dyambu ti lonkidi luzolo lwandi lulwingi. Kansi, muntu wu bakwe lemvokilanga ndambu, wukwe lonkanga luzolo lu fyoti.» <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Mboki Yesu ni kateela ku mukento bewowo ti: «Masumu maku ma lemvokolo.» <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Bantu bamvimba ba banandi kintwadi ha meza batona mu ta ku nsye mitima myawu ti: «Yandi nani kadi, mu lemvokila masumu e?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Kansi Yesu wuteela mukento ti: «Kiminu kyaku ki kuvuukisi: yenda mu kiyenge.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bakento bedi kwe landingi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ku manima, Yesu wuyenda mu zimbanza na mu mabwala mu kwe longi na mu kwe samuni Musamu Wumbote wu Kimfumu ki Nzambi. Milongoki kumi na myole miba nandi kintwadi, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />na mwa ndambu yi bakento ba kaduukisa mpeve zimbi na ba kanyakisa bimbevo: Maliya, wuba kwe tumisinanga mwisi Mangadala, wu kaduukisa mpeve nsambwadi zimbi, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Zani, mukento wu Kuza, muntu wuba munkebi wu mwvilu wu Elode, Susana na babingi bakaka, bedi sadisanga Yesu mu bimvwama byawu.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki kisadi ki mfuba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Bantu bafuma ku zimbanza zizingi, bayiza kutakana ha bela Yesu. Yandi wubateela kingana eki: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Kisadi kimfuba kiyenda mu kwe mwanga nswanga. Bu kedi kwe mwangi nswanga, ndambu nswanga yibwa ha sambu di nzila: bantu badyata yo na banuni badya yo. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ndambu yihiika yibwa ha butoto bu ba na matadi: bu yimena, yawu yiyuma, mu dyambu ti butoto buba kyototo ko. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Na ndambu yihiika yibwa ha kati di bititi binsende, yawu yimena ha kimosi na bititi binsende na bititi binsende bifyetikisa yo. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Kansi zihiika zibwa ha butoto bumbote, zikula mpe zibuta mimbutu mimingi, nkama mu bikanka.» Yesu bu kamana bateela bobo, wusasula ndinga mu ngolo ti: «Wonso wuu na makutu mu yuwa, bika kayuwa!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bila nki Yesu kana zonzila mu bingana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Milongoki myandi mi mufuula mbangudulu yi kingana bekyokyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Wubateela ti: «Lutambudi luve mu zaba mansweki ma kimfumu ki Nzambi, kansi ku bahiika, mu bingana bana batela myo, mu dyambu ti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">yawu balendi tala, kansi bana yena kima ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">mboki balendi yuwa, kansi bana bakula nakani kima kimosi ko.»<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbangudulu yi kingana ki muntu wuyenda mwanga nswanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Yuweno mbangudulu yi kingana bekiki: nswanga, ni Mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Yi mu ndambu nzila, ni bantu bakwe yuwanga Mambu ma Nzambi, kansi nkadyampemba bu kaakwiza wubakatudi mo mu mitima myawu, mwanki balembolo kwikila mpe balembolo baka mpulusu. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Yi ha butoto bu matadi: ni bantu bakwe yuwanga Mambu ma Nzambi mpe bakwe tambulanga mo mu kyese. Kansi malendi mena myanzi ko, bakwe kwikilanga mu ntangu yifyoti, kansi ti ntontolo yi batudidi, bakwe bwisanga kiminu. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Nswanga zibwa ha kati di nsende, ni bantu bebobo bakwe yuwanga Mambu ma Nzambi, kansi manyongo mawu, bimvwama, mpe minkembo mi kinza mikwe sanga ti Mambu ma Nzambi maba mafyetakana mu kizingu kyawu, na makwe butanga mimbutu miyela ko. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Nswanga zibwa ha butoto bumbote, ni bantu bebobo bakwe yuwanga Mambu ma Nzambi mu mutima wukwikama na wumbote. Bakwe lundanga mo na bakwe butanga mimbutu mu lutatumunu lwawu.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kimwinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mlk 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />«Kunani muntu wukwe lemisanga mwinda, mboki kafuka wo ku nsye kisiku hoti katuula wo ku nsye mbuka. Kansi kafweti we tentika ha yulu meza, mwanki bantu baakota mu nzo bayena kya. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Mu dyambu ti misamu mimvimba mi miswama myaayenika, mpe mansweki mamvimba maazabakana ha mwini ngemba. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Ni hahoho, lwengeeno kweno mu nyuwileeno eno, mu dyambu ti baahaana ku wonso wuna kima, mbo ba mubwesa kihiika, kansi ku wonso wulembolo ba na kima, mbo ba mukatula mpe ndambu yi kaabanzila ti yi nandi.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngudi na mpangi zi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Ngudi na mpangi zi Yesu bayiza mu tala, kansi balembana mu tula ha kabela mu dyambu di mpumbu yi bantu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Bateela Yesu ti: «Ngudi aku na mpangi zaku ha mbazi badi batelama na batiidi mu kuyena.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Kansi Yesu wuvutula ti: «Ngudi ani na mpangi zani, ni yobobo bakwe yuwanga Mambu ma Nzambi, na bakwe sadilanga mo.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudingimisa kitembo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Kilumbu kimosi, Yesu wukota mu kati di mulungu na milongoki myandi na wubateela ti: «Tusabukeeno ku simu dikaka di dyanga.» Ni bayenda. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Bu bedi sabuka, Yesu wubwa tolo. Bayutukulu kwawu, kitembo kingolo kikukula mu dyanga, mulungu wutona mu teboka mu mamba na baba ku nsisi yi lufwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Milongoki mifinama ha ba Yesu ni bamusungika na bata ti: «Mulongisi, Mulongisi, tu na saka fwa!» Yesu wusungama, wubamina kitembo na bipo bimamba ma dyanga. Bitumbu huza napii na kizunu kivutuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Mboki, wubateela ti: «Hambo kiminu kyeno kwedi kidi e?» Milongoki miba na bunkuta na miyituku bubwingi, mpe bedi kifuulasananga yawu na yawu ti: «Muntu bewuwu nani kadi e ? Mu dyambu ti wuna haana lutumu ku kitembo mpe bipo bimamba ma dyanga mpe bina mutumimina!»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa muntu wuba na mpeve zimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Batula ku kizunga ki bisi-Ngelaseni, kii simu na simu na mbanza yi Ngalili. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu bu katotoka mu mulungu, bakala dimosi di mbanza beyoyo, diba na mpeve zimbi diyiza mubwani. Tuuka ntama kedi lwatanga binkutu ko mpe kedi zakidilanga mu nzo ko, kansi yandi ku ndyamu kaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Bu kayena Yesu, wufukama ha ntadisi andi na wulooka mu ngolo ti: «Yesu, Mwana wu Nzambi Yihyokidi Kuzangama, nkye dyambu ngeye na meno e? Mulemvo aku, ku nkwamisandi ko!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Kedi zonzila bobo, mu dyambu ti Yesu wutuma ku mpeve yimbi yi totoka mu nitu andi. Mu dyambu ti ntangu zizingi, mpeve beyoyo yedi mukwamisanga ni bedi mu bindikanga moko na malu mu bisengo, kansi ni kedi tabulanga byo, mboki mpeve ni yedi munatanga ku nsi yinkatu. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu wumufuula ti: «Nkumbu aku nani e?» Yandi wuvutula ti: «Nkumbu ani babingi.» Yandi wuta bobo mu dyambu ti mpeve zimbi zizingi zikota mu yandi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Mpeve zimbi zibombidila Yesu mu lembolo batuba ku bulu dinsisi.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Kuba na kamba di zingulu dyedi dyanga ha yulu mulandu. Na mpeve zimbi zi bombidila Yesu ka babika benda bakota mu kati di zingulu. Ni kababika benda bakota mu zingulu. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Mpeve zimbi zitotoka mu bakala bedyodyo na ziyenda kota mu zingulu. Kamba dimvimba di zingulu dilundumuka tuuka ku yulu mulandu natee ziyenda bwa mu dyanga na zimana dyama. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Minkengi mi zingulu bu bayena bobo, bawoka na bayenda mwangisa nsangu mu mbanza na mu mwa zinzo zimimvungi. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Bantu bayenda mu tala misamu bwedi mihyokila, batula ha bela Yesu, na bayena bakala bedyodyo di katotola mpeve zimbi wuba wuzakala ha ndambu yi malu ma Yesu, wuba wulwata binkutu na kimuntu kyandi kisikama. Bunkuta ni bu babaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Yobobo bayena bonso bwedi misamu mihyokila, babayadila mpolo, bwedi bakala bedyodyo kanyakina. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Bantu bamvimba ba kizunga ki Ngelaseni balomba ku Yesu kenda kwandi, mu dyambu ti bayena bunkuta bubwingi. Yesu ni kakota mu mulungu na wuyenda kwandi. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Bakala bedyodyo di katotola mpeve zimbi wulomba ku Yesu kenda nandi kintwadi. Kansi Yesu wu muvutula na wumuteela ti: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Vutuka ku nzo aku na yenda wuta kimbangi mu mimvimba mi kuhiidikidi Nzambi.» Bakala bedyodyo di vutuka, mboki wumwangisa nsangu ku mbanza yimvimba mu mimvimba mi mu hiidikila Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wufulukisa mwana wu Yayilo na wunyakisa mukento wusimba kinkutu kyandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Bu kavutuka, mpumbu yi bantu yiyiza bwana Yesu, mu dyambu ti bamvimba bedi mukingilanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Kuba na bakala dimosi nkumbu andi Yayilo, mfumu yi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo kaba. Wuyiza fukama ha malu ma Yesu na wumubombidila kenda ku nzo andi, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />mu dyambu ti mwana andi wakwa wumosi wuba wu mukento, wu mvula kumi na zole, wuba lukufi mu fwa. Bu kedi kwe yenzi, mpumbu yi bantu yedi kwe mufyetakani.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Kuba na mukento wumosi wuba na kimbevo kye kwe totokingi menga, kizingila mvula kumi na zole. Wumanisa mvwilu andi yimvimba ku mimbuki. Kansi, kani muntu kalenda mu mubuka ko. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Wufinama kumanima ma Yesu na wumusimba mu sambu di kinkutu kyandi. Mboki, kimbevo kye kwe totokingi menga ki tumbu hwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu wufuula: «Nani wunsimbidi e?» Bamvimba bu babisa kwawu, Petelo ni kamuteela ti: «Mfumu, mpumbu yi bantu yi kuzungididi, na yina kwe kufyetakani.» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Kansi Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Kedika, muntu wunsimbidi, mu dyambu ti, nyeni ti lulendo luduukidi mu nitu ani.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Mukento bewowo, bu kayena ti bamubakudi, wuyiza mu kintekoto mpe wufukama ha malu ma Yesu na wubangula ha ntadisi yi mukangu wumvimba, bila nki kamusimbidi na bwedi kanyakini mu kilokola bekyokyo kwandi. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Kansi Yesu wumuteela ti: «Mwana ani, kiminu kyaku ki kuvuukisi, yenda mu kiyenge.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Tekila Yesu kamanisa mu zonza, muntu wumosi wufuma ku nzo yi mfumu yi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo wuyiza muteela ti: «Mwana aku wufwidi, ku kwamisandi Mfumu ko.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Kansi Yesu bu kayuwa bobo, wuteela ku Yayilo ti: «Kubandi na bunkuta ko, sa kwandi kiminu, mwana aku waanyaka.» <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Bu katula ku nzo yi Yayilo, katya mu kota na muntu mu nzo ko, tala ti ka Petelo na Yoane na Zaki mpe na ngudi na tata di mwana ko. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Bamvimba bedi dila na kunyonga mu dyambu di mwana. Kansi Yesu wubateela ti: «ludilandi ko. Kafwidyandi ko, kansi tolo kwandi kabwidi.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Baseyila Yesu, mu dyambu ti bazaba ti wufwa kadi. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Kansi, Yesu wumusimba mu koko na wuzonza mu ngolo: «Mwana, telama!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Kihumunu ki mwana kivutuka na wutumbu telama. Yesu wu batuma ba muhaana bindya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Ngudi na tata di mwana bayituku bubwingi. Kansi Yesu wu bakanikina mu ta ku bantu musamu bewowo wuhyokidi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Kisalu ki milongoki kumi na myole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mlk 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu wutumisa milongoki kumi na myole na wubahaana lulendo na luve mu kuma mpeve zimbi zimvimba na mu nyakisa bimbevo. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Wubafidisa mu mwangisa Musamu wu Kimfumu ki Nzambi na mu nyakisa zimbevo. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Wubateela ti: «Ka lunatandi kima mu nzyetolo eno ko, ka muti ko, ka nkuta ko, ka mbongo ko, mpe lunatandi binkutu byole ko. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Yonso nzo yi baalutambula, beno momo natee kilumbu ki lwaakwenda. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Konso ku baalembolo lutambula, bu luna duuka mu mbanza beyoyo, kubuleeno fundu-fundu di bitambi byeno bonso kimbangi mu mavanga mawu mambi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Bu bayenda, bedi kwe hyokidingi mu mabwala mamvimba mu kwe mwangisi Musamu Wumbote, na mumvimba bedi kwe nyakisingi zimbevo.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elode wuna sosa muyena Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mlk 6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Elode ntinu yi Ngalili wuyuwa misamu mimvimba myedi hyoka, madyela ni mamuhwa. Mu dyambu ti bantu bahiika bedi kwe tengi ti: «Yoane wufulukidi mu bafwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Bahiika ti: «Eliya yenikini.» Bahiika dyaka ti: «Mumbikudi wumosi wuntama wufulukidi mu bafwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ni hahoho, Elode kateela ti: «Yoane! Meno natuma ti ba mutabula mutu. Bwabu yondowo nani, wu nina yuwila nsangu zi bobo e?» Ni kedi sosa mu muyena.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudikila mafunda matanu ma babakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Bantumwa bu bavutuka, bayadila Yesu mimvimba mi bahidika. Mboki Yesu wubanata, wuyenda nawu ha kibuka kilembolo ba bantu, ku ndambusu yi mbanza yi Betesayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Mpumbu zi bantu bu zi bakula ni zi mulanda. Wubatambula na wubazonzila misamu mitadidi Kimfumu ki Nzambi. Wunyakisa yobobo baba na nsatu yi lunyakusu. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Bwisi bu butoona mu yila, zintumwa kumi na zole ziyiza muteela ti: «Vutula mpumbu zi bantu mwanki benda basosa ku balenda bwila tolo na baka bye dya mu mabwala na mwa zinzo zi mimvungi, mu dyambu ti huma ha tudi ha na kima ko.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Kansi wubateela ti: «Bahaaneeno yeno bende bindya!» Bamuvutudila ti: «Mampa matanu na mbizi zole kwandi zi neto, kadi buna ti twenda yeto bende tu sumbila bantu bamvimba be baba bindya.» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Baba mafunda matanu ma babakala. Yesu wuteela ku milongoki myandi ti: «Bazakiseno mu makabu makumatanu matanu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Ni basadila bo. Babazakisa bamvimba. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Wubonga mampa ma matanu na mbizi zole, wusendola meso ku yulu ni kasakumuna byo. Bu kamana bye bukuna ni kahaana byo ku milongoki myandi mwanki bakabula ku mpumbu yi bantu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Bamvimba badya na bayukuta. Ku manima, baludisa mikuta kumi na myole mu bibuku bisadila.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo wuta ti Yesu ni Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mlk 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Kilumbu kimosi, Yesu wedi sambila ha kibuka kilembolo ba bantu, milongoki mpe miba nandi kintwadi. Buna wubafuula ti: «Mu nzonzolo zi bantu, meno nani nidi e?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bamuvutudila ti: «Bantu bana ta ti Yoane Mbotiki wudi, bahiika ti Eliya, bahiika dyaka ti wumosi mu mimbikudi mintama wufulukidi mu bafwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Na wubateela ti: «Bwabu yeno bwedi lunata, meno nani nidi e?» Petelo wumuvutudila ti: «Ngeye ni Mesiya ma Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuzaabisa lufwa na mfulukulu andi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mlk 8.30–9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu wutoma badika mulembolo we ta ku kani muntu ko. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Wubwesa ta ti: «Bufweni ti Mwana Muntu ka yena mpasi zizingi. Bambuta na zimfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi na milongisi mi Misiku baamunyafuna. Mbo bamuhonda na mu kilumbu kibitatu, waafuluka mu bafwa.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ku manima wuta mpe ku bamvimba ti: «Tala ti muntu tiidi mu ndanda, kakizimbakana yandi bende, kananguna kulunsi dyandi kadi kilumbu na kandanda. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Mu dyambu ti wonso muntu waasosa mu vukisa luzingu lwandi, lwaakahombisa. Kansi wonso muntu waahombisa luzingu lwandi mu dyambu dyani, lwaakavuukisa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Nkye ndandu kwandi ku muntu beki bimvwama bi nza yimvimba, tala ti zimbisi luzingu lwandi hoti hombisi lo yandi bende e? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Kedika, wonso muntu waayena nsoni mu meno na mu mambu mani, buna Mwana Muntu mpe mbo kamuyenina nsoni mu ntangu yi kaavutuka mu nkembo andi, mu mukembo wu Tata andi na wu zimbazi zi longo. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Wukedika nina luteela, mwa ndambu bantu mu yobobo ba haha, baakifwila ko tala ti bayeni kimfumu ki Nzambi ko.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukituka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mlk 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Yesu bu kamana zonza, bilumbu nana bihyoka kumanima, wuyenda ha kimosi na Petelo na Yoane na Zaki ha yulu mulandu mu sambila. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Mu ntangu yi kedi sambila, kini kyandi kikituka na binkutu byandi biyiza ba na vekoveko. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Bu bayitukulu kwawu, ni babakala bole bedi mokana nandi: Eliya na Mose, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />bayenika mu nkembo, bedi zonzilanga nkwendolo andi bwedi yaahyokila ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petelo na banandi babwa tolo tu mpondi. Kansi bu bavumbuka, bayena nkembo andi na babakala bole batelama nandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Mu ntangu yi bahambana nandi, Petelo wuteela Yesu ti: «Mulongisi, bumbote mu zakala haha. Tutungeeno zinzo zitatu zi bikapu, yimosi yi yaku, yimosi yi Mose na yimosi yi Eliya.» Kedi zaba misamu mikedi ta ko. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Bu kedi zonza bobo, tuti diyiza na di bafuka. Bayena bunkuta bubwingi mu ntangu yi bedi kota ku nsye tuti. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Mpe ndinga yimosi yi yuwakana ku nsye tuti: «Yandi ewu ni mwana ani wu nasodidi. Muyuwileeno!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ndinga beyoyo bu yiyuwakana, buna Yesu weka yandi hiika. Milongoki miba na swii. Mu ntangu beyoyo, milongoki ba ta misamu bemyomyo mi bayena ku kani muntu ko.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa mwana wuba na mpeve yimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mlk 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Kilumbu kilanda, bu bakulumuka mulandu, mpumbu yiyinene yi bantu yiyiza mu bwana. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ha kati di mpumbu, bakala dimosi ditumbula ndinga na dita ti: «Mulongisi, ndevokila, na kulombidi wunyakisa mwana ani mu dyambu ti mwana wawuwu kwandi wunani! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Mpeve yimbi yikwe mulwatanga na yikwe musanga ti kenda lookani, mpe yikwe muningisanga mu ngolo, yikwe mutotolanga mafulu mu munwa na mu mpasi yikwe mukatukilanga buna yimeni muhongisa. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ndombidi ku milongoki myaku bakuma yo, kansi balembani kwawu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu wuta ti: «Ha! Yi mbandu yi lembolo ba na kiminu mpe yi vila, ntangu kwa naaba neeno mpe naaluvibidila e? Twala mwana aku eha.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mwana bu wuba bela-bela na Yesu, nkadyampemba wumulosa ha nsi na wumuningisa mu ngolo. Kansi Yesu wubamina mpeve yimbi mpe wunyakisa mwana na wu muvutula ku tata andi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Bamvimba bayituku mu mpila lulendo lu Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu wuzabikisa dyaka mfwilu andi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Bamvimba bedi yitukungu mu myo mi kedi sanga, wuteela milongoki myandi ti: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Yuweeno misamu emi: Mwana Muntu waayekolo mu moko ma bantu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Kansi, bazaba musamu bewowo ko, mu dyambu ti wuba wuswekama mwanki balembolo bakula mbangudulu, na bedi yena bunkuta mu mufuula mu musamu bewowo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nani hyokidi bunene ha kati dyeno</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mlk 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Bayumana yawu na yawu mu zaba nani ha kati dyawu hyokidi bunene. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu wuzaba mayindu ma mitima myawu, wubonga mwa mwana wumosi na wumutuula ha ntendo andi <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />na wuta ti: «Wonso muntu waatambula mwana bewuwu mu nkumbu ani wuntambudi meno bende, mpe wonso wuntambudi, tambudi yondowo wumfidisi. Mu dyambu ti yondowo hyokidi bukeke ha kati dyeno, ni yandowo vudidi bunene.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wonso lembolo ba mutantu eno ni mukundi eno</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mlk 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Mu vutula mvutu, Yoane wuta ti: «Mulongisi, tuyeni muntu wumosi wuna kuma mpeve zimbi mu nkumbu aku, ni tusosidi mu mukanikina mu dyambu ti kana kwe kulandi kintwadi neto ko.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Lumukanikinandi ko, kedika, wonso muntu lembolo ba mutantu eno, ni mukundi eno.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwala bumosi bu Samaliya bubisa mu tambula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Bilumbu bye tomboka ku yulu bu bifwana, wubonga nzengolo mu kwenda kaka ku Yelusalemi, <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />ni kafidisa bitwami ku mutwala andi. Bayenda na bakota ha bwala bumosi bu bisi-Samaliya mwanki bakubika nyizulu andi. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Kansi, bisi bwala bebobo bamutambula ko mu dyambu ti wedi kwenda ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Bu bayena bobo, Milongoki myandi Zaki na Yoane bamuteela ti: «Mfumu, tiidi ti tulomba tiya tu kulumuka ku yulu na twiza tu bayoka na yengi-yengi e?»<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Wubabalukila na wubabamina. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Mboki bahyokila ku bwala buhiika.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batiidi mu landa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Mu ntangu yibaba mu nzila, muntu wumosi wumuteela ti: «Nina kulanda konso-konso ku waakwendisa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Mibaku mi na miduka, nuni zi yulu zi na mazanza, kansi Mwana Muntu ka na kibuka kye humina ko.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Wuteela ku wuhiika ti: «Ndanda.» Yondowo ni kamuvutudila ti: «Mfumu, mpeka luve nateka kwenda ziika tata ani.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Wumuteela ti: «Bika bafwa bazikasana yawu na yawu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.60 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bika bafwa bazikasana yawu na yawu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbangudulu yihiika eyi: Ki kisalu kyaku ko mu zika zimvumbi</char></note>, kansi ngeye yenda wusamuna Kimfumu ki Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Wuhiika wumuteela ti: «Naakulanda Mfumu, kansi mpeka luve na teka kwenda haana mbote yi mansukina ku kanda dyani.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Wonso muntu simbidi nsengo ha kooko na bwesi tadisa ku manima, kafwanakani mu kimfumu ki Nzambi ko.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wufidisa makumi nsambwadi na myole mi milongoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ku manima ma misamu bemyomyo, Mfumu wusoola makumi nsambwadi na myole mihiika mi milongoki na wubafidisa bole-bole batekila mu kadi mbanza na mu bibuka bikafweti kwenda yandi bende. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Wubateela ti: «Kisalu kye yonzika mimbutu kikinene kidi, kansi bisadi bikeke bidi. Buna lombeeno ku Mfumu yi ngyonzokolo kafidisa bisadi mu kwiza yonzika mimbutu. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Yendeeno! Nina lufidisa bonso baala ba mameme ha kati di zingo. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Lunatandi mbongo ko, ka nkutu ko, ka nsampatu ko. Luhyokisandi ntangu mu kwe heeki mbote mu nzila ko. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Yonso-yonso nzo yi lwaakota, teeno ebu: “Kiyenge kiba mu nzo beyiyi.” <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Tala ti muntu wu kiyenge wu momo, kiyenge kyeno kyaaba nandi, tala ti kani, mbo kyaluvutukila. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Beno mu nzo beyoyo, dyeno na nweno bimvimba bi baaluhaana, mu dyambu ti kisadi fweni baka mufutu andi. Lwendandi lambaladi nzo ka nzo ko. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Mu yonso mbanza yi lwaakota na baalutambula, dyeno byonso bi baluhaana, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />nyakiseeno zimbevo zimomo na bateeleno ti: “Kimfumu ki Nzambi kyeka lukufi neeno”. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Kansi mu yonso mbanza yi lwaakota na balembolo lutambula, yendeeno mu nzila zizinene na teeno ti: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />“Kati fundu-fundu di mbanza eno dinamitini mu bitambi byeto, dya tuna kubula mu luvutudila dyo, kansi zabeeno ti Kimfumu ki Nzambi kyeka lukufi.” <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nina luteela ti mu kilumbu kyaaba mfundusu, mbanza beyiyi yaatambula kitumbu kivudidi ngolo na ki mbanza Sodomo.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbanza zi lembolo kwikila mu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Kyadi ku yeno, bisi-Kolazine! kyadi ku yeno, bisi-Betesayida! Mu dyambu ti bimangu bihilama ku yeno ni bihilama ku Tile na ku Sidoni, nganunu ntama bamana viluka, balwata zinkutu na bazakala ha yulu bombe. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ni hahoho, kilumbu kyaaba mfundusu, kitumbu ki lwaabaka kyaavudila ngolo na ki zimbanza Tile na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Ngeye Kapenawumi, wuna banza ti baakuzangula natee ku yulu e? Kani, baakukulula natee ku nsi yi bafwa!» <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yesu wuteela dyaka milongoki myandi ti: «Wonso waaluyuwila, nyuwidi, wonso waalubisa, mbisidi mpe bisidi yondowo wu mfidisi.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutukulu yi makumi nsambwadi na myole yi milongoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Milongoki makumi nsambwadi na myole mivutuka mu kyese na mita ti: «Mfumu, nkatika mpeve zimbi mpe zi tu tumimini mu nkumbu aku.» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Wubateela ti: «Meno nyeningi Satana sotokiningi tuka ku yulu bonso mpedamu.» <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Yuweno: Meno naluheeni lulendo mu dyata zinyoka na zinkutu-nkutu, na mu dyata lulendo lumvimba lu mutantu. Kedika, kunaani kima kilendi lusa bubi. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Luyangalalandi mu dyambu ti mpeve zimbi zilutumimini, kansi yangalaleeno mu dyambu ti nkumbu zeno zi zisonama ku yulu.<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyese ki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Mu ntangu beyoyo, Mpeve Yilongo yi fulusa Yesu mu kyese na wuta ti: «Na ku kembidi ngeye Tata, Mfumu yi yulu na butoto, mu dyambu ti zabikisi ku mwa baala bafyoti misamu bemyomyo mi wusweka ku bandwenga na ku banga madyela. Ninga Tata, mu dyambu ti ngeye bwabobo wu tiidi bubela.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Tata ani wumpeka bimvimba. Kunani muntu zebi Mwana, tala ti ka Tata ko, mpe kunaani muntu zebi Tata tala ti ka Mwana ko, na ku yobobo Mwana katiidi mu muzabikisa.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Mboki Yesu wubaluka kubela milongoki, wubateela yawu hiika ti: «Kyese ku meso mana yena mi luna yena! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Kedika nina luteela, mimbikudi mimingi na zintinu batya mu yena mi luna yena, kansi bayena ko, na batya mu yuwa mi luna yuwa, kansi bayuwa myo ko.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muntu wumbote wu mwisi-Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Mulongisi wumosi wu Misiku wuteelama mu tonta Yesu, wuta ti: «Mulongisi, nki fweti sa mu baka luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu e?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yandi wumuteela ti: «Bwedi basonika mu Misiku e? Nki tengi e?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Mu muvutudila mvutu, wuta ti: «“Zola Mfumu Nzambi aku mu mutima aku wumvimba na mu mwela aku wumvimba na mu ngolo zaku zimvimba na mu madyela maku mamvimba”, mboki “zola mfinangani aku bonso ngebende”.» <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Mboki wumuteela ti: «Mvutu yimbote heeni, sadila bobo na mbo wuzinga.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Kansi, yandi mu kilonka ti kyuvu kyandi kisungama kidi, wuta ku Yesu ti: «Nani wudi mfinangani ani e?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Mu vutula mvutu, Yesu wuta ti: «Bakala dimosi dituuka ku Yelusalemi mu kulumuka ku Yeliko. Wubwilu ku bimpumbulu, ba mubonga bimvimba biba nandi, ba mu tuta nkuba, basala musisa wutabuka ngambu, ni bayenda kwawu. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Kuba na Nganga-Nzambi yimosi yedi kulumukina mu nzila beyoyo. Wumuyena, kansi hyokidi kwandi mu lutengo. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Bumosi mpe, mu-Leviti wumosi wuyiza tula ha kibuka bekyokyo. Wumuyena, kansi hyokidi kwandi mu lutengo. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Kansi mwisi-Samaliya wumosi wuba mu nzyetolo wutula ha kabela. Bu kamuyena, wumufwila kyadi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Wufinama, wubulumuna mafuta na vinu mu zimputa, kengi zo bitende. Ku manima, wumunanguna , wumutuula ha yulu kibulu kyandi, wumunata ku nzo yi banzenza na wumusadisa. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Bukya namene, wuduukisa mbongo zole zi bisengo. Wuhaana zo ku mfumu yi nzo yi banzenza na wumuteela ti: “Musadisa, ntentoko yi mbongo zi watotola, mbo na kufuta yo meno bende bu naavutuka.”»<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Mu ngeye, nani mu ya batatu fwanakani muba mfinangani yi muntu bewowo wubwilu ku bimpumbulu e? <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Wuta ti: «Yondowo wumufwila kyadi.» Yesu wumuteela ti: «Yenda, ngeye mpe, sadila bumosi.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mu nzo yi Malata na Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Mu ntangu yi kedi kwe yenzi, wukota ha bwala bumosi, mukento wumosi wumubwana, nkumbu andi Malata. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Wuba na mpangi yimosi, nkumbu andi Maliya. Maliya wuba wuzakala ha ndambu yi malu ma Mfumu na wedi yuwa malongi mandi. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Malata wuba ntelantela mu bisalu, ni kayenda ta ti: «Mfumu, wuna yena mpasi ko ti mpangi ani kambikila meno kaka bisalu e? Muteela kiza kambakisa.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Mu muhaana mvutu, Mfumu wumuteela ti: «Malata, Malata, wuna kikwamisa na weka ntelantela mu misamu mimingi. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Kima kimosi kaka kii mfunu. Maliya sodidi kikunku kivudi kimbote, balendi kye muzyona ko.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na lusambulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Kilumbu kimosi, Yesu wedi sambila ha kibuka kimosi. Bu kamana sambila, wumosi mu milongoki myandi wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, tulonga bwedi tu lendi sambidilanga, bonso Yoane kalonga ku milongoki myandi.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Bu lwaasambilanga, tangeeno ebu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Tata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">bika nkumbu aku yiba yilongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">bika Kimfumu kyaku kiza!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Tuhaana, bindya byeto bi kadi kilumbu.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Tulemvokila masumu meto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">bonso yeto mpe, tukwe lemvokilanga bakwe tusanga bubi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">na wutukotisandi mu mpukumunu ko.”»<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Mboki, wubateela dyaka ti: «Mboti wumosi muyeno wele tala nkayi andi mu kati-kati dimpimpa mu muteela ti: “Nkayi ani, nsompisa mampa matatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />mu dyambu ti nkayi ani yimosi yi fumini ku nzyetolo yizidi, mpe nina kima kye muhaana ko.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Ti nkayi andi mu kati dinzo wukuvutudidi ti: “Biika mu nkwamisa, mwelo wukangama wudi, baala bani na meno bende tu balambalala, ndendi vumbuka dyaka ko mu kuhaana mampa.” <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Meno nina luteela ti, kati kavumbuka ko mu dyambu di kikundi kyawu, kansi, mu dyambu ti watatamana mu mukwamisa, waavumbuka mu muhaana bima bimvimba binandi nsatu. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Meno bwabu nina luteela ti: Lombeeno na baaluhaana, soseeno mpe lwaabaka, konkoteeno na baaluzibudila. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Ni hahoho, wonso waalomba, waatambula, mboki wonso waasosa waabaka na baazibudila ku yondowo waakonkota. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Nkye tata ha kati dyeno, lenda haana nyoka ku mwana andi tala ti wumulombidi mbizi e? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Hoti, lenda muhaana nkutu-nkutu tala ti wumulombidi diiki e? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Mpeleko yeno nkatika bantu bambi ludi, luzebi muhaana bima bimbote ku baala beno. Bila nki Tata eno wu ku yulu kalendi lembolo haanina Mpeve Yilongo ku bana mu lomba yo!»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutu yi Yesu ku Bafalisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mlk 3.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Kilumbu kimosi, Yesu wedi kuma mpeve yimbi yi kitula muntu wumosi baaba. Mpeve yimbi beyoyo bu yiduuka, baaba di zonza na mpumbu yi bantu yi yituku. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Kansi mwa kabu di bantu dita ti: «Mu lulendo lu Belizebuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Belizebuli: nkumbu yihiika yi Satana</char></note>, mfumu yi mpeve zimbi, kana kumina mpeve zimbi!» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bantu bahiika mu mutonta, bamulomba ka balonka kidimbu kya fuma ku yulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Kansi Yesu wuzaba mayindu mawu na wubateela ti: «Tala ti bantu bakintinu kimosi bakabukidi yawu na yawu kimwangani, na zinzo zawu za bwa ha yulu nzo zihiika. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Tala ti Satana wuna kinwanisa yandi bende, bwedi kimfumu kyandi kyaatatamana mu zingila e? Mboki yeno luna ta ti mu lulendo lu Belizebuli nina kumina mpeve zimbi. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Tala ti meno mu lulendo lu Belizebuli nina kumina zo, bwabu nani wuna haana baala beno lulendo lwe kumina zo e? Ni hahoho baala beno mbo baba mimfundisi myeno. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Kansi, tala ti mu lulendo lu Nzambi nina kumina mpeve zimbi, kedika Kimfumu ki Nzambi bwabu ki tudidi ku yeno.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Mboti muntu wuna ngolo na binwanunu bifwana, nzo andi na mvwilu andi yimvimba yaaba ku nsye lukengolo. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Kansi, tala ti muntu wu muvudidi ngolo wizidi na wumututidi nkuba, waamuzika binwanunu byandi bimvimba bi kakwe silanga kivuvu na mbo kakabula ku banandi bima bimvimba bi kamuzikidi.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Wonso lembolo ba nani kintwadi, mbeni ani kadi, mpe yondowo kwe lembolo yonzikanga kintwadi nani, kwe mwangisanga.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutukulu yimpeve yimbi ku muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Tala ti mpeve yimbi yi totokidi mu muntu, yakwe dyengila mu nsi yinkatu mu kwe sosa kibuka ki kaaba. Tala ti kabeki kyo ko, mbo yaa ta ti: “Mbote na vutuka ku nzo ani yi nasisidi.” <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Bu kavutuka, bweni yo yikombolo na yihidiku bumbote. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Ni hahoho, kakwe landila mpeve nsambwadi zihiika zi muvudidi bubi, mboki zimvimba zaakwiza kota kintwadi nandi mpe za zakala mu nitu yi muntu bewowo. Ku manima kitezo ki muntu bewowo kyaalutila ku koba na bu kaaba ntete.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyese ki kedika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu bu kedi zonza misamu bemyomyo, mukento wumosi wuba ha kati di mukangu wuta ti: «Kyese ku mukento wu kubuta na wu kunwika mabene mandi!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Kansi Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Kyese ku bantu bebobo bakwe yuwanga mambu ma Nzambi na bakwe sadilanga mo!»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndombolo yi kidimbu kingitukulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Mukangu bu wedi yonzama, Yesu wubateela ti: «Mbandu beyiyi, mbandu yimbi yidi, yina sosa kidimbu, kansi ku kidimbu ki kaka kiba bahaana ko, tala ti ka ki Yona kaka ko. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Bonso Yona wuba kidimbu ku bisi-Ninive, bwabobo mpe Mwana Muntu kabeela kidimbu ku mbandu beyiyi. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Mu kilumbu ki mfundusu, ntinu yi mukento yi kizunga ki Sude yatelama ha ntadisi yi bantu bambandu beyiyi na waabafunda, mu dyambu ti fumini ku zinsi zi sukina butoto mu kwiza yuwa mambu ma ntinu Solomo ma fuluka mu ndwenga. Kansi ha kati dyeto ha na muntu wuvudidi ntinu Solomo! <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Mu kilumbu ki mfundusu, bantu bambanza yi Ninive baatelama ha kimosi na mbandu beyiyi na waabafunda, mu dyambu ti bisi Ninive bavilula madyela bu bayuwa ndongolo yi Yona. Kansi ha kati dyeto kuu na muntu wuvudidi Yona!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kya ki nitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Kunani muntu wukwe lemisanga mwinda, na swekidi wo hoti tutidi wo ku nsye kisiku. Kansi kafweti we tentika ha yulu meza, mwanki bantu baakota mu nzo bayena kya. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Diisu dyaku ni mwinda wu nitu: tala ti dimbote didi, nitu aku yimvimba yaaba mu kya. Kansi ti dibeela didi, nitu aku yimvimba mpe yaaba mu kati di tombe. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ni hahoho, toma keba kya ki naaku mwanki kilembolo kituka tombe. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Tala ti nitu aku yimvimba yi mu kya, mpe kani kinama kimosi ki mu tombe ko, nitu aku yimvimba ya kyenzoka, bonso bukwe ku kyenzolanga mwinda.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wu semba Bafalisi na Milongisi mi Misiku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu bu kamanisa mu zonza, wumosi mu Bafalisi wumutumisa ku nzo andi mu dya ha kimosi nandi. Yesu wuyenda kota na wuzakala ha meza. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mufalisi wuyituku bwedi Yesu kalembolo sukudila moko mandi teekila ka dya, bonso buba kifu kyawu. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Kansi Mfumu wumuteela ti: «Yeno Bafalisi, lukwe sukulanga mbungu na ndonga zeno ku mbazi, kansi ku kati di mitima myeno ku fuluka na mpwila yi bwivi na mbalu. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Bizengi bimpamba ludi! Nzambi wuhidika bi ku mbazi ka yandi ko wuhidika bi mu kati e? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Kabileeno ntete bamputu bi mu kati, mboki bimvimba byaaba bivedila ku yeno.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Kansi kyadi ku yeno Bafalisi! Yeno lukwe haananga kibuku ki kumi-kumi ki bikola bi bonso manzulu, ki bikola bikwe menanga bya bende na ki bikola bi mumpila-mumpila, kansi lukwe zimbakananga lunungu na luzolo lu Nzambi, misamu myamyomyo lufweti sadila, ka mu zimbakana minkaka ko.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Kyadi ku yeno Bafalisi! Lukwe tyanga mu zakala ha byandu bintete mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo, na lukwe tyanga bantu benda luheekingi mbote zi buzitu mu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">byanzala: kibuka kikwe yonziminanga bantu babingi ku bahiika ha bakwe tumisinanga mwanzu </char></note>byanzala. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Kyadi ku yeno! Ludi bonso zindyamu zikwe lembolo zabakananga, zikwe kwe dyatingi bantu kondo kuzaba!»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Wumosi mu milongisi mi Misiku wumuteela ti: «Mulongisi, buteedi bobo, yeto kwandi mpe tukidi!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu wuvutula ti: «Kyadi ku yeno mpe milongisi mi Misiku! Lukwe twikanga bifunda bikizitu ku bantu mu nata, kansi yeno bende lukwe sinsanga mu bye nanguna kani mu mulembo wumosi ko. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Kyadi ku yeno! Lukwe tungilanga mimbikudi zindyamu, mpeleko ni matata meno ma bahonda! <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Zimbangi ludi bu lutambudi mavanga ma matata meno, mu dyambu ti yawu bahonda mimbikudi, mboki yeno lutungidi zindyamu zawu. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ni hahoho Nzambi kazonzila mu ndwenga ti: “Nina batambikila mimbikudi na zintumwa, mbo bahonda ndambu mu kati dyawu na mbo bafyetikisa bahiika.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Mwanki bantu ba mbandu beyiyi bafundusu mu dyambu di menga ma mimbikudi ma batengola tuuka mbadukulu yi nza, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />tuuka menga ma Abeli matengolo natee ku menga ma Zakaliya wu bahonda ha kati-kati di ziku di bakwe yokilanga minkayulu na kibuka kilongo. Ninga, nina luteela, bantu ba mbandu beyiyi bana fundusu mu bamvimba ba bahonda!<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Kyadi ku yeno milongisi mi Misiku! Kadi yeno lukatudi nsabi yi nzayulu, yeno bende lukwe mwe kotanga ko, kansi luna kakidila nzila ku yobobo baatidi mu kota momo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesu bu katotoka mu nzo beyoyo, milongisi mi Misiku na Bafalisi ba baka mankesi mangolo na bamuvwika byuhu mu misamu mi mumpila-mumpila: <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />basosa mu mubakila kibila mu mpova zedi duuka mu munwa andi!<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ndwengosolo ku banga diisu ku nsye lukaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mu ntangu beyoyo, bantu bedi kwe dyatasaningi mu dyambu ti mafunda na mafunda ma bantu makutakana, Yesu wutona mu zonza ku milongoki myandi ti: «Kebeeno kweno mu bilongo bi Bafalisi bikwe vimbisanga kiputi, ni diisu dyawu ku nsye lukaya. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Misamu mimvimba miswama myaayenika na mansweki mamvimba mazabakana. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Mu dyambu ti, mimvimba mi luteedi mu mpimpa, myaayuwakana mu mwini, mpe mi luzonzidi mu mfundu mu kati di bihinga bi nzo, myaabatumbula mu ngolo ku bantu.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nani lufweti yena bunkuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Yeno zinkayi zani nina luteela ti: lubandi na bunkuta mu yoyobo bakwe hondanga nitu ko, mpe kumanima, balendi hidika nakani kima ko. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Bika naluteela nani lufweti yena bunkuta. Yeneeno Nzambi bunkuta wuna lulendo lwe tuba muntu ku mbungulu bu kameni muhonda. Kedika, nina luteela, yandi lufweti yenanga bunkuta.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Kadi bakwe yadikanga maseke matanu mu mbongo zi bisengo zole ko e? Kansi Nzambi kazimbakani kani dimosi ko. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Kati milengi mi mitu myeno myakazebi lutangu. Luyenandi bunkuta ko, luvudidi mfunu na maseke mamingi.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutambula hoti kubisa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Nina luteela ti: wonso muntu wantambula ha meso ma bantu ti yandi mulongoki ani kadi, Mwana Muntu mpe waamutambula ha meso ma zimbazi zi Nzambi, <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />kansi wonso wambisa ha meso ma bantu, Mwana Muntu mpe waamubisa ha meso ma zimbazi zi Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Mpe wonso waazonzila bumbi mu Mwana muntu, ba mu lemvokila, kansi wonso waatyaka Mpeve Yilongo, kaalemvokolo ko.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Bu baalunata mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo, ku zimfumu na ku minyaadi, lukikwamisandi ko mu zaba bwedi lwaazonzila na nki lwaata, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />mu dyambu ti Mpeve Yilongo yina lulonga mu ntangu beyoyo myo mi lwaata.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki mvwama yi kihulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Wumosi mu kati di mpumbu wumuteela ti: «Mulongisi, teela mpangi ani kakabula naani fwa diba tusisila.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yandi wumuteela ti: «Nani wunsodidi mu ba mumfundisi eno hoti mu kabula bimvwama byeno e?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Mboki wubateedidi ti: «Kebeno kweno mu nsatu yi bimvwama bi nza, mu dyambu ti luzingu lu muntu ludi mu bimvwama byandi ko kati kimvwama kikingi kinandi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Buna wubayadila kingana eki: «Mvwama yimosi yiba na bibiti bitoma buta mboongo yiyingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Wedi yindula ni ka kifuula ku nsye mutima andi ti: “Nki naasa mu dyambu ti nina kibuka kikingi kye lundila mboongo beyiyi ko e?” <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Mboki wuta dyaka ti: “Ebu naasila: nina mwangisa bilundulu byani, naatunga bivudi bunene, mboki naayonzika bele dyani dimvimba na mvwilu ani. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ku manima, naata ku meno bende ti: Mwela ani, weka na mvwilu yifwika yi lundamani mu mvula zizingi. Huuma kwaku, dya, nwa na yangalala mu kizingu kyaku.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Kansi Nzambi wumuteedidi ti: “Kihulu kinani wudi, mpimpa beyiyi kwandi mwela aku wa nabonga, bwabu bimvwama byaku bi wukubikidi ku nani byaasala e?”» <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />«Ni bwabobo budi ku muntu yonzikidi bimvwama bi yandi bende, kansi ha meso ma Nzambi ka mvwama ko.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuba na kiminu mu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yesu wuta ku milongoki myandi ti: «Bonso bu nalutedidi: ka lukikwamisandi mu dyambu di luzingu lweno mu bye dya, mpe mu dyambu di nitu zeno mu bye lwata. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Mu dyambu ti luzingu luvudi mfunu na bindya, mpe nitu yi hyokidi mfunu na binkutu. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Taleeno minganga: mi kunanga ko, mi yonzikanga ko, bana matanda na nzo zizinene ze lundila bima ko, mpe Nzambi kwe badikilanga. Yeno luhyokidi zinuni mfunu! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nani mu yeno mu nyongono zandi lenda bwesa fyoti bilumbu bi luzingu lwandi e? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Tala ti lulendi lenda mu sa mwa kima kifyoti ko, mu dyambu di nki luna ki kwamisina mu bima bihiika e? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Taleeno bwedi bifulu bimfuba bikwe kudilanga: bikwe salanga ko, bikwe syetanga ko, kansi nina luteela ti: Kaati Solomo mu bimvwama byandi bimvimba, kasala lwaata binkutu bivudidi ntoko bonso kifulu kimosi mu bifulu bebibi ko. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Tala ti Nzambi bwabobo kakwe lwikilanga bititi bidi bubedidi mu mfuba na mbazi bina tubu ku tiya, bila nki kalembolo lusila bo! Yeno bantu ba kiminu kifyoti ludi! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Lukikwamisandi mu kwe sosingi ko nki lwaadya na nki lwaanwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ni bantu balembolo ba Bayudayo ba nza beyiyi, bakwe kwe sosingi bima bimvimba bebyobyo, ntangu zimvimba. Kansi yeno, Tata eno zebi ti bii neeno nsatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Kansi, soseeno ntete Kimfumu ki Nzambi na mbo kaluhaana bihiika bisidi.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimvwama ki yulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Luyenandi bunkuta ko, yeno mwa kamba di mameme, mu dyambu ti Tata eno yeni ti bumbote mu luhaana Kimfumu. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Yadikeeno mvwilu zeno na haaneeno zo ku bamputu. Saleeno nkutu zimbongo zikwe lembolo bebanga, yonzikeeno bimvwama bi yulu bikwe lembolo hwanga, kokoko mwivi kutuula mpe na bansyedi kudya mpe. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kedika, honso ha kimvwama kyaku, hahoho mpe ha mutima aku.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisadi bikwe kayanga meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Kubameeno, melika nakekete mu luketo na minda minama. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Mpe beno bonso babakala bana kingila mfumu awu mu ntangu yi kaavutuka ku nzo, kumanima ma mukembo wu makwela, mwanki bu katula na bu kakonkota, ba tumbu muzibudila. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Kyese ku mindongo bemyomyo, mfumu bu katula, waakwiza ba bwana buna mina kaya meso! Kedika nina luteela, mfumu waakanga melika mu luketo, waabazakisa ha meza, mboki waabahaana bindya. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Tala ti wizidi mu nsusu yinzole hoti yimitatu na wizi ba bata bana kaya meso, kyese kyawu.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Yuweno: tala ti mfumu yi nzo zebi nkye kilokola kyaayizila mwivi, kalendi tala katobola nzo andi ko. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Yeno mpe beno bakubama, mu dyambu ti Mwana Muntu waakwiza mu kilokola ki lulembolo zaba.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kisadi ki kwikama na kilembolo ba kikwikama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petelo wumufuula ti: «Mfumu, mu yeto wunateela kingana bekiki hoti mu bamvimba e?»<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Mfumu wuvutula ti: «Bwabu, nkye munkebi wu mvwilu wukwikama wusodidi mfumu na wu kasiididi kivuvu, yondowo mfumu wukasoodidi mutwadisa bisadi byandi bimvimba na mu ba haana mu ntangu yi fwanakani kitezo ki bele? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Kyese ku mundongo bewowo, mfumu bu kaavutuka, wumubweni buna wuna sala. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Kedika nalutedidi: “Mbo kamutuula ha mutwala wu mvwilu andi yimvimba.” <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Tala ti mundongo bewowo teedi ku nsye mutima andi ti: “Mfumu ani kana tumbu vutuka ko”, na tonini mu tuta bisadi bi babakala na bi bakento nkuba, mu dya, mu nwa na mu kolo. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Mfumu yi mundongo bewowo bu kaavutuka mu kilumbu ki kana lembolo mu kingila na mu ntangu yi ka lembolo zaba, mbo kamuzenga mu bibuku byole na mbo kamuhaana kitumbu ha kimosi na balembolo kiminu. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Mundongo bewowo waazaba nsatu zi mfumu andi, kansi kakubikidi kani kima ko na kasadidi luzolo lwandi ko, mbo kamututa nkuba yi ngolo. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Mundongo bewowo waalembolo zaba nsatu zi mfumu andi na waahidika misamu mi fweti haanunu nsembolo, nkuba yifyoti baamututa. Ku yondowo wubaheeni bima bibingi, bima mpe bibingi baamulomba, ku yondowo wubaswekisi bima bibingi, bivudidi mpe bamulomba.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuna twala nkabani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Meno nizidi mu tuba tiya ha luse lu butoto bwabu ntiidi ti malumalu beyiyi tunama. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Meno mbotokolo yimosi nabaka mpeleko yina mfyetikisa beni natee bu ya lungisa nsilulu. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Lubanzidi ti na yizidi mu lu haana kiyenge ha luse lu butoto e? Kani, kansi na luteedidi ti nkabani. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Kedika mu ntangu beyiyi, bantu batanu ba nzo yimosi ba hambana, batatu babela bole, na bole babela batatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Mbo ba kabuka: tata waabela mwana wu bakala na mwana wu bakala waabela tata, mama waabela mwana wu mukento na mwana wu mukento waabela mama, buko bu mukento waabela kikwezi ki mukento na kikwezi ki mukento waabela buko bu mukento.<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuzaba mu tanga bidimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu mpe wuta ku mpumbu yi bantu ti: «Bu lwaayena tuti dina tomboka ku wesete, mu ntangu beyoyo, luteedi ti: “Mvula yi kitembo yaanoka.” Mpe yinokini. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Mu ntangu mupepe wukwe fumanga ku ndambu yi sude bu waakukula, luteedi ti: “tiya tu nsisi twaaba.” Mpe twizidi. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Yeno bankwa diisu ku nsye lukaya, luzebi mu tanga bidimbu bi yulu na butoto bina yenika, bwedi luna lembikinina mu tanga ntangu beyiyi e?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyuwasani na mutantu ani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Mu dyambu di nki lukwe lembolo kifundisilanga yeno bende mu zaba dyambu dimbote e? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Kedika, tala ti wenzi mpe mutantu aku ha ntadisi yi mumfundisi, mu nzila yuwasaneeno, lumanisa nandi mwanki kabika mu kunata ha ntadisi yi mumfundisi, nga mumfundisi mbo kakuyekola ku muntu kwe sadilanga ntumunu zinzo yi lufundusu mpe yandi waa ku tuula mu boloko. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nkatika nakuteedidi, wulendi duuka mu boloko ko tala ti kumeni mu futa mfuka aku ko natee ku mbongo yi kisengo yimanunu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kuviluka hoti kufwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Mu ntangu beyoyo, mwa ndambu yi bantu bayiza yala mpolo ku Yesu mu misamu mi sa Pilatu bu kahondisila bisi-Ngalili mu ntangu yi bedi yoka minkayulu ku Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu wu bavutudila ti: «Mu mpila mpasi zibobo zi bayena, yeno luna banza ti bisi-Ngalili bebobo bafwa, bavula masumu na bisi-Ngalili bahiika e? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Kaani, meno nina luteela ti, tala ti luviludi madyela ko, yeno bamvimba mpila mosi lwaafwila. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Mboki, bantu kumi na nana bafwa ku nsye nzo yi kibanga yibwa ku Silowa, luna banzila ti yawu bavula masumu ha kati di bantu bamvimba ba mbanza yi Yelusalemi e? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Kaani, meno nina luteela ti, tala ti luviludi madyela ko, yeno mpe mpila mosi lwaafwila.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki muti wu fike wukwe lembolo butanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Mboki Yesu wubateela kingana eki: «Bakala dimosi diba na muti wu fike wu kakuna mu mfuba andi yi miti mi vinu. Ni kayiza sosa mbutu kansi kabaka kima ko. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Ni hahoho kateela ku kisadi kyandi ti: “Taleeti kwaku, mvula tatu zimvimba nkwe kwiza sosanga mbutu mu muti wu fike bewuwu, kansi nabakanga kani mbutu yimosi ko. Kwanga wo kwandi! Bila nki wuna fukisilanga butoto mu mpamba e?” <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Kansi kisadi ki mfuba yi miti mi vinu wu muvutudila ti: “Mfumu, bikeeti wo dyaka mvula beyiyi, mbo natima muntendo muti, mboki naatuula mbodila. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Nanga waabuta mbutu mimvu myaakwiza, tala ti kaani, mbo wukwanga wo.”»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa mukento wuba nakyeta kilumbu ki saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Mu kilumbu ki saba, Yesu wedi longa mu kati di nzo yimosi yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Muba na mukento wumosi wedi kwamusungu ku mpeve yimbi tuka mvula kumi na nana, wuba na mungongo nakondondo na wedi lembananga mu sungama. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu bu kamuyena, wumutumisa na wumuteela ti: «Mama, ngeye kudulu mu kyeta kyaku.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yesu wu mutentika moko, mu ntangu beyoyo kwandi, nitu andi yi tumbu sungama na wukembila Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Kansi mfumu yi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo wufwema, mu dyambu ti Yesu wunyakisa mukento bewowo kilumbu ki saba. Na wuteela mukangu ti: «Bilumbu bisambanu bidi mu sala, lufweti kwizanga mu bukusu mu bilumbu bebyobyo, kansi ka kilumbu ki saba ko!» <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Mfumu wu muvutudila ti: «Yeno bantu ba diisu ku nsye lukaya ludi! Kunani muntu ha kati dyeno kwe lembolo nyangunanga ngombe andi hoti mbuluku andi kilumbu ki saba, mu kwe ye nwika mamba e? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Mukento bewuwu mpe, mwana wu Abalahami wudi, mpe Satana wumukanga mvula kumi na nana, nga kafwanakani ko mu munyanguna misinga bemimi mu kilumbu ki saba e?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Mvutu beyoyo yi haana Yesu yi yenisa mitantu myandi nsoni, na mukangu wumvimba wu yangalala mu misamu mimbote mi kedi hidikanga.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki nswanga yi mutaade</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu wuta ti: «Mu nki naafwanikisa Kimfumu ki Nzambi e? Na nki kifwanani e? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Kifwanakani na nswanga yi muti wu nkumbu mutaade yi kunini muntu mu mfuba andi yi bikunu, bu yimenini, yeka muti, mboki banuni batungidi mazanza mawu mu bintala byandi.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki bilongo bikwe vimbisanga kiputi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu wuta dyaka ti: «Mu nki naafwanikisa Kimfumu ki Nzambi e? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Kifwanakani na kima kikwe vimbisanga kiputi ki mampa ki bongidi mukento na vukidi kyo na bitezo bitatu bi faline natee kimvimba bu kivimbidi.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwelo wufyetama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu bu kedi kwenda ku Yelusalemi, wedi kwe longi mu zimbanza na mabwala ma kedi kwe hyokidingi. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Muntu wumosi wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, wukedika ti bantu bafyuma kwandi ba vulusu e?» Yesu wumuvutudila ti: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Sadileeno ngolo mu kotila mu mwelo wufyetama. Kadi, meno nalutedidi ti, babingi baasosa mu kota, kansi baalenda ko.<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Mfumu yinzo bu katumbu telama, na bu kaakanga mwelo, mpe yeno lwaasaala ku mbazi, lwaatoona mu konkota ha mwelo na mu ta ti: “Mfumu, tuzibudila!” Mbo kaluvutudila ti: “Nzebi ko yeno kwedi lufumini!” <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Luna toona mu ta ti: “Yeto tudiidi na tunwiini naaku ha kimosi, na wulongidi mu zinzila zimbanza zeto.” <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Yandi mbo kaluteela dyaka ti: “Nzebi ko yeno kwedi lufumini. Nkatukileeno, yeno bamvimba lusadidi bubi!” <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Ni kwakoko, lwaadidila, mpe lwaakwetisila meno, bu lwaayena Abalahami, Isaaki na Yakobi, mpe mimbikudi mimvimba mu Kimfumu ki Nzambi. Kansi, yeno baalutuba ku mbazi! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Bantu baafuma ku esete mpe ku wesete, ku node na ku sude, baazakala ha meza mu Kimfumu ki Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Ni hahoho, bantu baazimunina baatekila, mboki baatekila baazimunina.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na mbanza yi Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Mu ntangu beyoyo kwandi, mwa ndambu yi Bafalisi bayiza muteela ti: «Yenda kwaku na katuka kwaku haha, mu dyambu ti Elode tiidi mu kuhonda.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Yendeeno luteela mubaku bewowo: “Bubedidi na mbazi nina kuma mpeve zimbi na nina nyakisa, mpe kilumbu ki bitatu naamanisa kisalu kyani.” <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Kansi bubedidi na mbazi mpe kilumbu kyalanda, mfweti tatamana nzila ani. Mu dyambu ti, bufwanakani ko ti bahondila mumbikudi ku mbazi yi Yelusalemi.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Yelusalemi! Yelusalemi! Ngeye kwe hondanga mimbikudi mpe kwe hondanga mu matadi bantu bakwe ku tambikanga Nzambi! Ntangu zizingi natiidi mu kutikisa baala baku bonso nsusu kakwe kosilanga baala bandi ku nsye mahahi, kansi lutiidi eno bo ko! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Bwabu, nzo eno ya babwongodi. Meno wa nina luteela ti: Lwaabwesa nyena ko natee kilumbu ki lwaata ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 13:35">“Bika Nzambi kasakumuna muntu wuna kwiza mu nkumbu yi Mfumu!”»<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa mbevo yimosi kilumbu ki saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Kilumbu kimosi ki saba, Yesu wuyenda kota mu nzo yi mfumu yimosi yi Bafalisi mu dya nawu. Bafalisi ni bedi mutalanga. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Mpe bakala dimosi diba na nkunki diba ditelama ha ntadisi andi . <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Buna Yesu wufuula milongisi mi Misiku na Bafalisi ti: «Nga musiku eto wulendi tu haana luve mu nyakisa mu kilumbu kisaba hoti kani e?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Hamuhaana muntu mvutu ko, kansi Yesu wusimba mbevo, wumunyakisa na wumuvutula. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Wubateela ti: «Nani mu yeno, tala ti mwana andi hoti ngombe andi yi yibwidi mu bulu kilumbu ki saba, walembolo tumbu kwe tombola wo e?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Balembakana muhaana mvutu mu kyuvu bekyokyo.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsodolo yi kibuka ha mukembo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu bu kayena bantu ba batumisa ku mukembo bwedi bedi kwe kalangani bibuka bintete, wubateela kingana eki ti: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Tala ti muntu wu kutumisi ku mukembo wu makwela, kwendandi wuzakala ha kibuka kintete mu dyambu ti bulendi ba ti ku na muntu wu kuhyokidi mfunu batumisi, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />mpe yondowo wulutumisi yeno babole lenda kwiza kuteela ti: “Mubiikila kibuka.” Mbo wuyena nsoni mu kwe zakala ku manima. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Kansi bamana kutumisa, yenda wuzakala ha kibuka ki manima, mwanki yondowo wu lutumisi bu kaakwiza, waakuteela ti: “nkayi ani, yiza wuzakala ku mutwala.” Bwabobo waabakila masiika ku bamvimba baazakala naaku ha meza. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ni hahoho, wonso waakizangula baamukulula na wonso waakikulula baamuzangula.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Ni kata mpe ku yondowo wu mutumisa ti: bukwe hidikilanga ndambisa yi mwini hoti yi busuku, kutumisandi zinkayi zaku ko, zimpangi zaku ko, tata na ngudi aku ko, na ka mvwama zikwe banga bela-bela naaku ko. Mu dyambu ti yawu mpe balenda kutumisa na baakuvutudila myo mi wubasididi. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Kansi bu waahidikisa ndambisa yi mukembo, tumisa miwelo, baa na malu matabuka, baa na byeta na bampofo. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Mbo wuba mu kyese mu dyambu ti ba na kima kimosi kye kuvutudila ko. Nzambi waakuhaana musendo aku haaba mfulukulu yi bantu baa lunungu.<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki ndambisa yiyinene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Bu kayuwa kingana bekyokyo, wumosi mu yobobo baba nandi ha meza wuteela Yesu ti: «Kyese ku yondowo waadya mu Kimfumu ki Nzambi!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Wumuvutudila ti: «Bakala dimosi wukubika ndambisa yiyinene na wutumisa bantu babingi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Mu ntangu ye dya, wufidisa mundongo andi mu teela ba katumisa ti: “Yizeno, mu dyambu ti bimvimba bikubamani” <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Kansi bamvimba baahaana mpengomokono mu mutindu wumosi. Wuntete wumuteela ti: “Mfuba na sumbidi mfweti kwenda ye tala. Nina kulomba wu ndemvokila.” <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Wuhiika wumuteela ti: “Ngombe kumi na sumbidi, nenzi mu kwe zesinsa, nina kulomba wu ndemvokila.” <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Wuhiika dyaka teedi ti: “Mbo ha kwa na kwedidi, ndendi kwiza ko.” <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Bu kavutuka, mundongo wuzaabisa mimvimba ku mfumu andi. Ni hahoho bu kabaka mankesi, mfumu yi nzo teedi ku mundongo andi ti: “Yenda nswalu, mu zinzila zizinene na zizikeke zi mbanza mpe twala kuku miwelo, baa na malu matabuka, bampofo na baa na byeta.” <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Mundongo teedi ti: “Mfumu, nsidi bonso buwutumini, kansi bibuka byakiidi.” <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Buna mfumu wuteela ku mundongo ti: “Yenda nswalu mu zinzila zi zimfuba na ku zimpangu, na kwikisa bantu biza bakota mwanki nzo ani yi fuluka. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kedika nina luteela, ka bakala dimosi ko mu yobobo baantumisi waabimba ndambisa ani!”»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kudya ndefi mu landa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Mpumbu yiyinene yi bantu yi yenda nzila yimosi na Yesu bu kabaluka (kasyetoka) wubateela ti: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Tala ti muntu tiidi mu ba mulongoki ani, fweti tya kuhyoka tata andi, ngudi andi, mukento andi, baala bandi, mpangi zandi zi babakala na zi bakento mpe luzingu lwandi ko. Tala ti kasidi bo ko, kalendi ba mulongoki ani ko. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Wonso walembolo nanguna kulunsi dyandi mu kwe ndandi, kalendi ba mulongoki ani ko. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Kedika, nani ha kati dyeno tiidi mu tunga nzo yi kibanga, tala ti kazakadi ntetentete ko mu zaba ntalu yi mbongo na mu zaba tala ti ya kalenda mu manisa. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ti kabwako waatungisa lufulu, kansi kamanisa yo ko. Bamvimba baamuyena, bakwe museyi <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />na mbo bata ti: “Bakala bedidi ditona mu tunga nzo kansi kalenda mu manisa yo ko!” <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Nkye ntinu, yaakwenda nwana mvita na ntinu yihiika, walembolo teka zakala mu fyongonina mu zaba tala ti mu mafunda kumi ma bantu lenda nwanisa ntinu yihiika wu na mafunda makumole. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Tala ti kaalenda ko, mbo kafidisa kitwami ku wuhiika bu kakidi kukula mu mulomba kiyenge. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ni hahoho, wonso-wonso ha kati dyeno tala ti kabiikidi mvwilu andi ko, kalendi ba mulongoki ani ko.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mungwa wulembolo ba mfunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Mungwa wumbote wudi. Kansi tala ti weka na zubulu, bwedi tulenda we vutudila nzenzo e? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Wusidi kisalu ko, kani mu dyambu di butoto na kani mu dyambu di mbodila, ku mbazi baalosa wo. Yondowo wuna makutu mu yuwa kayuwa!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki dimeme di zimbala na di yenikini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Kilumbu kimosi, Mitoti mimpaku na minsumuki bayenda yawu bamvimba ha bela Yesu mu muyuwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Bafalisi na Milongisi mi Misiku bavunguta, ni bata ti: «Bakala bedidi wuna tambula minsumuki na wuna dya kintwadi nawu!» <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Kansi Yesu wubateela kingana eki: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Nkye muntu ha kati dyeno wudi na nkama yi mameme, mboki zimbisi dimosi, walembolo sa sisa mameme makumivwa na vwa ko ku nsi yinkatu, mu kwe sosi dimeme bedyodyo di zimbadi natee bu kayena dyo e? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Bu kayeni dyo, yangaladi, bongidi dyo na tudidi dyo ha yulu mahembo mandi, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />mpe bu kavutukidi ku nzo andi, tumisi zinkayi zandi na bantu bakwe banga mu nzo zi bela-bela nandi na wubateedidi ti: “Yangalaleeno ha kimosi nani, mu dyambu ti dimeme dyani di bedi dizimbala dyanyeni!” <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ni hahoho mpe, nina luteela ti kyese kyaalutila ku yulu mu dyambu ti munsumuki wumosi wu viludi madyela, kansi ka mu makumi vwa na vwa ko ma bantu bambote balembolo ba na nsatu ye viluka.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki mbongo zi bisengo zi zimbala na zi bayena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />«Hoti, nkye mukento wu na mbongo kumi zi bisengo, mboki zimbisi kimosi, waalembolo namisa mwinda mu muswalu na waalembolo kombola nzo na sosa mu bunkete natee bu kaayena mbongo bezozo e? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Bu kayeni zo, tumisi zinkayi zandi na bantu bakwe banga mu nzo zi bela-bela nandi, waabateela ti: “Yangalaleeno ha kimosi nani, mu dyambu ti nyeni mbongo zi nazimbisi!” <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Bwabobo mpe, nina luteela ti kyese kikingi kyaaba ku zimbazi zi Nzambi mu dyambu di munsumuki wumosi wu viludi madyela.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki mwana wu zimbala na wu yenika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu wuta dyaka ti: «Bakala dimosi diba na baala bole ba babakala. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Kilezi wuteela tata andi ti: “Tata, mpana kikunku kyani kimvwilu”. Buna tata wukaba mvwilu andi ku baala bandi ya babole. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Mwa bilumbu kwandi bihyoka, kilezi wutekisa mvwilu andi, mboki wuyenda ku nsi yiyila. Ku nsi beyoyo wufukisa mvwilu andi mu zinga mu bunsuza. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Bu kamana fukisa mvwilu andi yimvimba, malema ma ngolo ma kota mu nsi beyoyo, mpe ni katoona mu kondo bimvimba. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Buna wuyenda sonama mu kisalu ku bakala dimosi di nsi beyoyo, wumutuma mu kwe dikidingi zingulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Yandi wuba na nsatu mu dya bindya byedi dyanga zingulu, kansi kani muntu ka muhaana byo ko. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Ni hahoho katona mu yindula na wuta ku nsye mutima andi ti: “Bisadi bimvimba bi tata ani banabindya bibingi na bikwe saadilanga, kansi meno, kukuuku, nina fwa mu nsatu! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nina vutuka ku tata ani mpe mbo namuteela ti: Tata, meno nahodidi masumu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi na ha ntadisi aku, <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />mfwanakani dyaka ko, ti ba ntumisina mwana aku. Mbongila bonso wumosi mu bisadi byaku.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ni kavutuka ku tata andi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«Buna wakidi kitatu na nzo, tata andi wu muyenina kyadi kikingi: wunooka mu kwe mu bwana, wumuzingama mu nsingu na wu mufiba.»<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />«Buna mwana wumuteela ti: “Tata, meno nahodidi masumu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi mpe ha ntadisi aku, mfwanakani dyaka ko ti wu ntumisina mwana aku.” <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Kansi tata wuteela bisadi byandi ti: “Seeno muswalu mu mutwadila kinkutu kivudidi kitoma na mulwikeeno kyo, mpe mulwikeeno kimpambula mu mulembo na nsampatu mu malu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Twaaleeno mwana ngombe wuvuluka, mpe hondeeno wo, tudyeeno na tuseeno mukembo. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Mu dyambu ti mwana ani bewuwu wubedi wufwa, kansi fulukidi, wubedi wuzimbala, kansi yenikini.” Na batona mukembo.»<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />«Mu ntangu beyoyo, mwana wuntete wuba ku mfuba. Bu kavutuka na bu kaba bela-bela na nzo, wuyuwa lusuku lu mikunga na makinu. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Wutumisa wumosi mu bisadi byawu mu mufuula nkye musamu kwandi wu ku nzo. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Kisadi wumuteela ti: “Mpangi aku vutukidi, tata aku hondidi mwana ngombe wuvuluka, mu dyambu ti vutukidi wu muhinya.” <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Buna mwana wuntete wufwema na wubisa mu kota mu kati di nzo. Tata andi wuduuka mu mubomba. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Kansi wuvutula ku tata andi ti: “Mimvu mimingi na ku sadidi mpe nakolamani kani ntumunu aku yimosi ko, mpe wampeeni ka mwa mwana nkombo ko, mwanki na yangalala na zinkayi zani. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Kansi mwana aku ewu bu kavutukidi, yandi wumeni fukisa mwvilu aku yimvimba mu bansuza, wumuhondidi mwana ngombe wuvuluka!”» <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Tata wumuteela ti: «Mwana ani, ngeye ntangu zimvimba kwe banga nani, mpe mvwilu ani yimvimba, yi yaku yidi. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Kansi bumbote budi mu sa mukembo na mu yangalala, mu dyambu ti kilezi kyaku eki beedi wufwa, kansi fulukidi, beedi wuzimbala, kansi yenekini!»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki munkebi wu mvwilu wumadyela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu wuta dyaka ku milongoki myandi ti: «Bakala dimosi dimvwama diba na munkebi wu mvwilu andi, bantu bayiza mufunda ti mvwilu andi kena bunganga. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Bu kamutumisa, wumuteedidi ti: “Nki nina kwe yuwingi mu ngeye e? Nyadila bonso bu wusadidi mvwilu ani, mu dyambu ti waabwesa ba munkebi wu mvwilu ani ko.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Munkebi wu mvwilu wuta ku nsye mutima andi ti: nki kwandi ndendi sa, mu dyambu ti mfumu ani wuna nkatula mu kisalu e? Kusala mfuba e? Nina ngolo ko, na sa mundombila e? Mbo nayena nsoni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ha! Nzebi nki naasa, mwanki bantu ba ntambulanga mu zinzo zawu tala ti bankatudi mu kisalu ki munkebi wu mvwilu. <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Mboki ni katumisa wumosi-wumosi mu yobobo bedi defa mfumu andi. Wuta ku wuntete ti: kikwa wuna defa mfumu ani e? <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Wuvutula ti: nkama di bidunda bi mafuta ma olive. Munkebi wu mvwilu wumuteela ti: bonga kipapila kyaku, zakala munswalu, sonika makumatanu. <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Wuteela ku wuhiika ti: Ngeye, kikwa wuna defa e? Wuvutula ti nkama di zingoto zibele. Ni kamuteela ti: Bonga kipapila kyaku na sonika: makuminana. <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Mfumu wusiika munkebi andi wumbi mu mpila madyela makabaka mu huna. Mu dyambu ti, bantu ba nza beyiyi bavudidi madyela na baala bakwe zinganga mu kya ku Nzambi mu nzakululu yi yawu na yawu.<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: “Meno ebu nina luteela: bakeeno zinkayi mu bimvwama bi babakidi mu nzila zimbi, mwanki mu ntangu yi byaahwa, balutambula mu zinzo zi mimvu ka mimvu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Muntu wu wukwikama mu mwa kima kifyoti, wudi mpe wukwikama mu kima kinene. Muntu wulembolo ba na ludedomo mu mwa kima kifyoti, kadi mpe na lunungu ko mu kima kinene. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Tala ti lulembakani mu ba bakwikama mu bimvwama bi bakulu mu nzila zimbi, nani kwandi waaluhaana bimvwama bi kedika e? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Tala ti lubedi bakwikama mu bima bingana ko, nani waaluhaana bi yebende e?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Kunani kisadi kilendi sadila mfumu zole ko. Mu dyambu ti, mbo kabela wumosi na waatya wuhiika, hoti mbo kayekama ku wumosi na mbo kanyafuna wuhiika. Lulendi sadila ha kimosi Nzambi na mbongo ko.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndongolo zi Yesu zi mumpila-mumpila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Bafalisi batiidi mbongo, bedi seha Yesu, bu bedi yuwa misamu bemyomyo mimvimba. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Luna kiyenikisa ba lunungu ha ntadisi yi bantu, kansi Nzambi zebi mitima myeno, mu dyambu ti kima kikwe yenikanga mfunu ha meso ma bantu, kidi kisafuka ha meso ma Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Masonama mu Misiku mi Mose na mimbikudi mitatamana natee mu ntangu yi Yoane Mbotiki, yiba ntangu yi Misiku mi Mose na mimbikudi. Ku manima, natee mu ntangu beyiyi, musamu wumbote wu kimfumu ki Nzambi wuna samunwanga. Wonso muntu wuna sadila ngolo mu kota momo. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Yulu na butoto byaazimbala nayaki-yaki, kansi ka mwa kisono kimosi ki Misiku kilendi katuka ko.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Dyonso bakala dyaakuma mukento andi, mboki kwedidi wuhiika, sadidi kinsuza, mpe bakala dyaakwela mukento wuba kumini ku makwela ku mulumi andi, sadidi mpe kinsuza.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki muntu wu mvwama na Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Kuba na bakala dimosi di mvwama, dyedi lwatanga binkutu bintoko na bintalu beni, bilumbu bimvimba mu kyese na mu minkembo kedi bye hyokisilanga. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ha mwelo nzo andi, haba na muwelo wumosi nkumbu andi Lazalo. Nitu andi yimvimba, yiba na zimputa. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Wedi tyanga mu dya mfumfula zedi bwanga ku nsye meza ma mvwama. Kansi bambwa ni bedi kwiza mu hendanga mputa zandi. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Muwelo wuyiza fwa, mboki zimbazi zi munata ha ntadisi yi Abalahami. Mvwama mpe wuyiza fwa na bamuzika. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Ku nsi yi bafwa, kwama kukwingi kedi yenanga, bu kasendola meso, wuyena kukula, Abalahami wuba na Lazalo ha ntendo andi. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Buna wulokana ti: “Tata Abalahami, mfwila nkenda na fidisa Lazalo kadobika nsongi yi mulembo andi mu mamba mwanki kambodika ludimi, mu dyambu ti kwama nina yena mu kati di milaka mi tiya bemimi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Kansi Abalahami wumuvutudila ti: Mwana ani, bambuka moyo ti ngeye wuba na bimvwama bibingi mu kizingu kyaku, mpe Lazalo wuba mu zimpasi zizingi. Bwabu yandi tambudi mbombolo. Kansi ngeye wu mu kati di kwama. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Mboki, ha kati-kati dyeto na yeno bulu di nsisi dihoho, mwanki ho yobobo batiidi mu kwiza ku ludi, balendi hyoka ko, bumosi mpe ku yobobo baa neeno koko, ka balendi sabuka ku tudi ko. <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Mvwama wuta ti: “Mulemvo aku tata! Nina kulomba, wufidisa Lazalo ku nzo yi tata ani, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />mpangi zitanu zinani koko, kabanatina kimbangi mwanki yawu mpe balembolo kwiza ku kibuka bekiki kina kwama kukwingi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Kansi Abalahami wumuvutudila ti: “Mpangi zaku ba na Mose na Mimbikudi mu balwengisa. Babayuwila!” <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Mvwama wumuteela dyaka ti: “Kani, tata Abalahami, tala ti muntu fumini ku nsi yi bafwa wenzi bayenikina, mbo baviluka.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Kansi Abalahami wumuvutudila ti: “Tala ti bayuwidi Mose na mimbikudi ko, batambula ko, kati muntu ni kafuma ku nsi yi bafwa.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Mulemvo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18.6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mlk 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu wuta ku milongoki myandi ti: «Misamu mikwe tesisanga bantu masakuba milendi kondo ko, kansi kyadi ku muntu wukwe tukisanga myo! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Bumbote ba mukanga tadi didinene mu nsingu na ba mu loosa mu mubu, nga ka mubwisa mu masumu wumosi mu baala bebaba bafyoti. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Kebeno kweno!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">«Tala ti mpangi aku sumukini, musemba. Kamana viluka, mulemvokila.<verse eid="LUK 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Kamana sumuka nkumbu nsambwadi mu kilumbu kimosi, mpe wizidi kulomba mulemvo mu ta ti: “Ntambudi bubi bwani”, mulemvokila.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiminu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Zintumwa ziteela Mfumu ti: «Kudisa kiminu kyeto.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Mfumu wuvutula ti: «Ti luna kiminu ki bunene bonso nswanga yi muti wu mutaade, lulenda tuma ku muti wu sikomole ti: “Tumuka, yenda mena mu mubu”, na walutumimina.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbindumunu zi kisadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />«Nani ha kati dyeno, wuna mundongo wukwe mu sadilanga mfuba na wukwe mu vungilanga mameme, ti fumini ku mfuba, waamuteela ti: “Sa muswalu mu kwiza zakala ha meza e?” <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Kaani, mbo ka muteela ti: “Ndambila bindya, sanza binkutu byaku mu nsadila ti bu na manisa mu dya na mu nwa, kumanima mbo wudya na kunwa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Nganunu lenda vutula matondo ku mundongo andi mu kisalu ki ka mutumini e? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Bumosi, yeno mpe: bu lumeni sala kisalu ki ba lutumini, teeno ti: “Bisadi bimpamba tudi, kisalu kyeto kwandi tusedi.”»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wunyakisa bantu kumi baba na bwazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu bu kedi kwenda ku Yelusalemi, wuhyokila mu ndilu yikwe kabulanga Samaliya na Ngalili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ha nkotolo yi bwala bumosi, bantu kumi baba na kimbevo kibwazi bayiza mu bwana na batelama kitatu nandi <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />na bazonza mu ngolo ti: «Yesu, Mulongisi, tufwila nkenda!» <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yesu wubayena na wubateela ti: «Yendeeno lukilonka ku zinganga-Nzambi.» Bu bedi kwe yenzi, ni banyaka. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Wumosi ha kati dyawu, bu kayena ti nyeki, wuvutuka. Bu kedi kwe vutuki, wedi kwe kembidi Nzambi mu ndinga yi ngolo. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Wuyenda fukama luse ha nsi ha malu ma Yesu, mu vutula matondo. Bakala bedyodyo diba mwisi Samaliya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu wuta ti: «Nganunu kumi dimvimba dinyeki ko e? Kansi ba vwa kwedi badi e? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Ka muntu ko mu yawu bamvimba benzi mu kwiza vutula matondo ku Nzambi, tala ti ka nzenza beyiyi ko e?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Mboki, Yesu wumuteela ti: «Telama, yenda, kiminu kyaku ki kuvuukisi.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwizulu yi Kimfumu ki Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24.23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Bafalisi bafuula Yesu ti: «nkye ntangu Kimfumu ki Nzambi kya kwiza e?» Wubavutudila ti: «Kimfumu ki Nzambi kyaakwiza bonso mona meso ko. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Baata ko ti: “Taleno, eku kidi!” Hoti “ekuna!” Kedika, Kimfumu ki Nzambi kii ha kati dyeno.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Mboki, wuteela milongoki ti: «Bilumbu byaakwiza bi lwaaba na nsatu ye yena Mwana Muntu, kati mu kilumbu kimosi kwandi, kansi lwaamuyena ko.» <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Bu baaluteela ti: «Ekuna kadi!» Hoti «eku kadi!» Lwendandi kooko ko, lwendandi kooko mu ntiinu ko. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Bonso mpedamu bu yikwe pedamanga ku yulu mu kyenzola ndambu ka ndambu, bwabobo mpe bwaaba kilumbu kyaakwiza Mwana Muntu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Kansi kafweti teka kwamusu bubwingi na fweti nyafunu ku bantu ba mbandu beyiyi. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Misamu mihyoka mu ntangu yi Nowa, myamyomyo kwandi mpe myaaba bilumbu byaakwiza Mwana Muntu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Bantu badya, banwa, bakwela, bakwedisa natee kilumbu ki kota Nowa mu nzaza, nyamba yiyinene bu yiyiza, yifuukisa bamvimba. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Bonso mu ntangu yi Loti: Bantu badya na banwa, basumba na bayadika, bakuna na batungisa, <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />kansi kilumbu ki duuka Loti mu Sodomo, tiya na fundu-fundu di tiya bifuma ku yulu binoka bonso mvula na bifuukisa bima bimvimba. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Bwabobo mpe bwaaba kilumbu kyaayenika Mwana Muntu.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />«Mu kilumbu bekyokyo, muntu kyekolo ku <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luhukulu (véranda) ni kibuka ki bonso mbazi yi bakwe mokinanga. </char></note>luhukulu lu muludi wu nzo andi, waaba na bima byandi mu kati dinzo, ka kakulumuka mu bye bonga, bumosi mpe ku yondowo kyekolo ku mfuba, ka kaavutuka ku nzo andi. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Bambukeno moyo mu mukento wu Loti! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Wonso muntu tiidi mu vuukisa luzingu lwandi, lwaakahombisa. Kansi yondowo waahombisa luzingu lwandi lwaakavuukisa. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Meno nina luteela ti: mu mpimpa beyoyo kwandi bantu bole balambalala mbuka yimosi: wumosi baabonga, wukaka baamusisa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bakento bole baanika ha kimosi mbutu: wumosi baabonga, wukaka baamusisa. [<verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Babakala bole baaba ku mfuba: wumosi baabonga, wukaka baamusisa.»] <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Milongoki mi muteela ti: «Mfumu, kwedi waahidimina e?» Na wuvutula ti: «Honso ha mvumbi, hahoho haayonzimina nuni zikwe dyanga mvumbi.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki foola na mumfundisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu wubateela kingana kimosi mu balonka ti bafweti sambilanga ntangu ka ntangu, kondo kwe lebakana. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Teedi ti: «Kuba na mumfundisi wumosi mu kati di mbanza yimosi, kedi yenanga Nzambi bunkuta ko na kedi vuminanga bantu ko. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Mpe kuba mu kati di mbanza beyoyo foola dimosi dyedi kwizanga ku yandi mu muteela ti: “Nzengila musamu bewuwu na mutantu ani.” <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Ntangu zimvimba wedi bisanga kwandi. Ku manima, teedi ku nsye mutima andi ti: mpeleko na yenanga Nzambi bunkuta ko mpe na vuminanga bantu ko, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />kansi, mu dyambu ti foola bedidi dina mana nkwamisanga, nfweti muzengila musamu andi mwanki kambiika mu mana nkwamisanga ntangu zimvimba.» <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Mfumu wuta dyaka ti: «Dimbeeno mina ta mumfundisi wulembolo ba na lunungu! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Nzambi kalendi nungisa bantu bandi ba kasoola ko, bakwe mu yawudilanga mpimpa na mwini e? Nganunu waabakingisa e? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Meno nina luteela ti, waabanungisa mu nswalu. Kansi, mu ntangu Mwana Muntu yi kaavutuka, waakwiza bwana bana kiminu ha nza e?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki mufalisi na mutoti mpaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu wuta kingana eki ku yobobo bakwe kiyenikisanga ti bantu balunungu badi na bakwe yinanga bahiika: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Babakala bole bayenda ku nzo-Nzambi mu sambila, wumosi wuba mufalisi, wuhiika mutoti mpaku. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Mufalisi, kimantelama, wusambila ku nsye mutima andi ebu: “O Nzambi, na ku tondidi mu dyambu ti ni bonso bantu bahiika ko, baa mivi, bambi na zinsuza, bonso mutoti mpaku bewuwu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nakwe minanga nsoki bilumbu byole mu kisabala mpe nakwe futanga kibuku kyani kikumi-kumi mu bimvimba bi nakwe bakanga.” <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Mutoti mpaku, yandi wuba mwa kitatu, kedi lenda mu sendola meso ku yulu ko. Kansi wedi baaba ha ntulu andi ni kedi ta ti: “Nzambi ani, mfwila nkenda meno munsumuki nidi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Kedika na luteedidi, mutoti mpaku wuvutuka ku nzo andi wuyambudulu, kansi ka mufalisi ko. Mu dyambu ti wonso waakizangula, baamukulula na wonso waakikulula, baamuzangula.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na baala bafyoti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bantu banata baala bafyoti ku Yesu mwanki kabasakumuna. Milongoki bu bayena bobo, bababamina. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Kansi Yesu wutumisa baala bafyoti na wuta ti: «Bikeeno baala biza ku meno, lubakakidilandi ko mu dyambu ti kimfumu ki Nzambi kifwanakani ku yobobo ba bonso yawu. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Kedika na luteedidi, wonso muntu waabisa mu tambula kimfumu ki Nzambi bonso mwana wufyoti, kalendi mwe kota ko.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na muntu wumvwama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mfumu yimosi yifuula Yesu ti: «Mulongisi wumbote, nki namfweti sa mu tambula luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu e?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Bila nki wuna ntumisina muntu wumbote e? Kunani muntu wudi wumbote, tala ti ka Nzambi kaka ko. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Misiku myazebi: “kusadilandi kinsuza ko, kuhondandi ko, kuyibandi ko, kutandi kimbangi ki luvunu ko, zitisa tata aku na ngudi aku.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Bakala bedyodyo divutula ti: «Tuuka kintwenya kyani, nkwe vuminanga Misiku mimvimba bemyomyo.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Bu kayuwa bobo, Yesu wumuteela ti: «Dyambu dimosi di kusidi: yadika bima byaku bimvimba, kaba byo ku bamiwelo, mbo wubaka kimvwama ku mazulu. Ku manima, yiza, mboki ndanda.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Kansi bakala bedyodyo bu kayuwa bobo, wukota mu kyadi mu dyambu ti wuba na bimvwama bibingi. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu bu kayena ti weka mu kyadi, wuta ti: «Mpasi ku bamvwama mu kota mu kimfumu ki Nzambi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Bulutidi nayaki-yaki ku kibulu ki na nkumbu yi samo mu lutila ha mwa bulu di ntumbu, kansi kamvwama ko mu kota mu kimfumu ki Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Yobobo bedi muyuwa bata ti: «Nani kwandi lenda baka mpulusu e?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu wuvutula ti: «Mikwe banga mpasi ku bantu, mi mpasi ku Nzambi ko.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Petelo wuta ti: «Bwabu yeto tumeni sisa bimvimba mu kulanda.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Kedika nina luteela, mu dyambu di kimfumu ki Nzambi, kunaani muntu waasisa, nzo andi, mukento andi, mpangi zandi zi babakala, ngudi na tata andi na baala bandi, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />waalembolo tambula bibingi mu ntangu beyiyi, mpe mu ntangu yina kwiza, luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuzabikisa dyaka lufwa na mfulukulu andi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu wukutikisa milongoki myandi kumi na myole na wubateela ti: «Yuweno, tuna tomboka ku Yelusalemi. Mimvimba misonama mu mimbikudi mu dyambu di Mwana Muntu, mina kwenda detila. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Baamuyekola mu moko ma bantu balembolo ba Bayudayo, baamuseha, baamutuka, baamulobodila mante, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />baamuzuba bikoti mboki baamuhonda. Mu kilumbu kibitatu waafuluka mu bafwa.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Kansi milongoki mibakula kani dyambu ko. Mbangudulu yi misamu bemyomyo yiba yi mansweki ku yawu, na bazaba ko Yesu nki kedi ta.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nyakisi mpofo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu wuba bela-bela na mbanza yi Yeliko, Mpofo yimosi yiba yizakala ha ntendo yi nzila yedi sanga mundombila. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Bu kayuwa lusuku lu mpumbu yi bantu yedi kwiza, wufuula ti nkye musamu kwandi wukoko e? <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bamuteela ti: «Ni Yesu mwisi Nazaleti wuna hyoka.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Ni kalokana ti: «Yesu, Mwana Davidi, wumfwila nkenda!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Bantu bedi kwe tekidi ku mutwala babamina mpofo mwanki kakanga munwa andi, kansi yandi wubulana dyaka mungolo ti: «Mwana Davidi, wumfwila nkenda!» <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu wutelama na wulomba bamunatina mpofo beyoyo. Bu kaba bela-bela, Yesu wumufuula ti: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Nki tiidi na kuhidikila e?» Wumuvutudila ti: «Mfumu, ntiidi na bwesa yena.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Bika meso maku mayena dyaka, kiminu kyaku ki kuvuukisi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Hansi na nsi, wutona mu bwesa yena. Mboki ni kedi kwe yenzi na Yesu buna wuna kwe kembidi Nzambi. Mukangu wumvimba bu wuyena misamu bemyomyo, wutona mu kembila Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Zakayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu wukota mu mbanza Yeliko na wuhyokila ha kati di mbanza. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Kuba na bakala dimosi nkumbu andi Zakayi, wuba mfumu yi mitoti mimpaku na wuba mvwama yiyinene. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Wusosa mu yena nani wuba Yesu, kansi mu dyambu di mukangu wu bantu na muteela andi wuba wuwukufi wulembana mu muyena. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Ni kanooka ku mutu na wuyenda maka mu muti wu nkumbu sikomole, mwanki kayena Yesu waahyokila hoho. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesu bu katula ha kibuka bekyokyo, wusendola meso ku yulu na wumuteela ti: «Zakayi, kumuluka mu muswalu, mu dyambu ti bubedidi ku nzo aku na bwila tolo.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Mu kyese, Zakayi wukulumuka mu muswalu mu mubwana. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Bantu bu bayena bobo, bamvimba bavunguta na bata ti: «Muntu bewuwu ku nzo yi munsumuki kena kwe bwila tolo!» <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zakayi wuba wutelama ha ntadisi yi Mfumu, wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, naahaana ku bamputu kati-kati di mvwilu ani, mpe tala ti nabongidi kima ki muntu mu luvunu, bitezo biya namuvutudila kyo.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Bubedidi, mpulusu yi kotidi mu nzo beyiyi, mu dyambu ti yandi mpe mwana wu Abalahami wudi. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Mu dyambu ti, Mwana Muntu wuyizidi mu sosa na mu vuukisa yobobo baba bazimbala.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki mbongo zi kisengo ziwola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Bantu bu bedi muyuwa, Yesu wu bwesa ta dyaka kingana, mu dyambu ti wuba bela-bela na Yelusalemi na bantu bedi banza ti Kimfumu ki Nzambi kyaayenika mu ntangu beyoyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Ni kabateela ti: «Bakala dimosi diba mukanda di bantu ba zangama diyenda ku nsi yiyila mwanki ba mubyeka ntinu, mboki kavutuka. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Tekila kenda, wutumisa kumi di mindongo myandi, na wubahaana ku konso muntu mbongo yi kisengo yimosi yiwola na wubateela ti: “Bangumuneeno zo natee bu naavutuka.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Kansi bantu ba nsi andi bedi mu belanga, ni batambika bantu kumanima andi mu kwe ta ti: “Yeto tutiidi ko muntu bewuwu ka tuyaala.” <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Bu bamana mubyeka ntinu, wuvutuka ku nsi andi. Ni katumisa mindongo mi ka sa sisila mbongo, mwanki kazaba ndandu yi ba beki. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Wuntete wuyiza na wumuteela ti: “Mfumu, mbongo yi kisengo yiwola yaku yi butidi ndandu yi mbongo zi kisengo kumi ziwola.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Buna wumuteela ti: “Bumbote siidi! kisadi kimbote wudi, mu dyambu ti, ngeye bedi wukwikama mu bima bifyoti, na kubyadisi mfumu yi zimbanza kumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Wunzole wuyiza na wumuteela ti: “Mfumu, mbongo yi kisengo yiwola yaku yi butidi ndandu yi mbongo zi kisengo zitanu ziwola.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Wumuteela ti: “Ngeye mpe bumosi na kubyadisi mfumu yi zimbanza zitanu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Wuhiika mpe wuyiza na wumuteela ti: “Mfumu, mbongo yi kisengo yi wola yaku eyi, mpe ya nasweka ku nsye kitende ki mulele. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Bunkuta kwe kuyenanga, mu dyambu ti ngeye muntu wumbalu wudi: ngeye kwe bonganga bima bi wulembolo lundisa, mpe kwe yonzikanga bi wulembolo kuna.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Mfumu wumuteela ti: “Kisadi kimbi wudi, nina kufundisa mu mpova zaku, ngeye zebi ti meno muntu wumbalu nidi, nkwe bonganga bima bi ndembolo lundisa, mpe nkwe yonzikanga bi ndembolo kuna. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Bila nki wulembolo tudila mbongo zani mu nzo yi kiswekolo ki mbongo e? Mu mvutukulu ani za nketi bakila ndandu bu naketi bonga zo.” <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Mboki, wuteela ku yobobo baba hoho ti: “Muzikeeno mbongo yi kisengo yi wola beyoyo yi nandi, mpe haneeno yo ku yondowo wuna mbongo zi kisengo kumi ziwola.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Bamuteela ti: “Mfumu, yandi mbongo zi kisengo kumi ziwola zi nandi!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />“Kedika nina luteela ti, mbo bahaana ku yondowo tekidi na kima, kansi yondowo lembolo ba na kyo, mbo ba muzika, na kyo kitekidi nandi. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Mu mitantu myani, milembolo tya ti nabayaala, bantwadileno haha mpe bazengeeno madinga ha ntadisi ani.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkotolo yi Yesu ku Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu bu kamana zonza bobo, wenzi ba ku mutwala wu mukangu, mu tomboka ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Bu kaba bela-bela na mabwala Betefange na Betani, ku mulandu wu nkumbu Olive, wutekisa milongoki myandi myole. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Wubateela ti: «Yendeeno ha bwala buu ku mutwala, bu lwaatuula koko, lwaayena mwana mbuluku wu wukangama ha muti, waka wameki muntu. Nyanguneeno wo, mpe twaleeno wo. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Tala ti muntu wulufuudidi: “Bila nki luna nyangunina wo e?” Muteela ti: “Mfumu wuna wo nsatu.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Milongoki miyenda, na miyenda bwana bonso bu bateedila Mfumu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Bu bedi nyangunanga mwana mbuluku, bavwidi wo babafuula ti: «Bila nki luna nyangunina mwana mbuluku bewuwu e?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Babavutudila ti: «Mfumu wuna wo nsatu.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ni banata wo ku Yesu, batentika binkutu ha yulu mwana mbuluku, mboki bamakisa Yesu ha yulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Bu kedi kwe hyoki, bantu ni bedi kwe yadi binkutu byawu mu nzila. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Bu kaba bela-bela mu kulumuka mulandu wu Olive, mukangu wumvimba wu milongoki, wufuluka mu kyese, na wedi kwe kembidi Nzambi mu ndinga yi ngolo, mu dyambu di bimangu bi bayena. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Bedi kwe te ti:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">«Bika Nzambi kasakumuna ntinu yina kwiza mu nkumbu yi Mfumu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">Kiyenge ku yulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">mpe nkembo ku Nzambi mu mazulu mahyokidi kuzangama!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Mwa ndambu yi Bafalisi yiba ha kati di mukangu bateela Yesu ti: «Mulongisi teela milongoki myaku mi dingalala.» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Wubavutudila ti: «Kedika nina luteela bamana dingama, ni matadi ma bulana!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudila mu dyambu di mbanza yi Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yesu bu kaba bela-bela na mbanza yi Yelusalemi, bu kayena yo, wudila mu dyambu di mbanza beyoyo, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Wuta ti: «Ha Yelusalemi! Tala ti ngeye mpe wu wuzaba, misamu milenda ku heeka kiyenge mu kilumbu bekiki! Kansi ntangu beyiyi mi miswama ku ngeye! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ku na bilumbu byaakutudila, mitantu myaku myaakwiza kuzunga mu bibaka bi butoto mu kunwanisa, myaakuzungidila na myaakufyetikisa mu ndambu ka ndambu. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Myaakumwangisa, ngeye na baala baku ha kati dyaku, mwa sala kani tadi ha yulu tadi nandi ko, mu dyambu ti wubakudi ntangu yi yizidi kubumina Nzambi ko!»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mu kati di nzo-Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yesu wukota mu nzo-Nzambi na wedi kuma mintekisi, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />wubateela ti: «Masonama: “Nzo ani yaaba nzo yi lusambulu.” Kansi yeno, lukitudi yo kiswamunu ki bimpumbulu!»<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yesu wulonga kadi kilumbu mu nzo-Nzambi. Mfumu zinganga-Nzambi, milongisi mi Misiku mpe bakuluntu ba mukangu, basosa bwedi bamuhondisila. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Kansi bazaba ko bwedi balendi sa, mu dyambu ti mukangu wumvimba wedi toma mu yuwilanga.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Kwedi kufuma lutumu lu Yesu ?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Kilumbu kimosi, Yesu bu kedi longanga mukangu mu nzo-Nzambi na bu kedi samunanga musamu wumbote. Mfumu zinganga-Nzambi na minsoniki mi Misiku batuula ha kimosi na bakuluntu, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />bamufuula ti: «Tuteela, mu lutumu lu nani wuna hidikila misamu bemimi mpe nani wukuheeni lutumu belulu e?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Wubavutudila ti: «Meno mpe kyuhu nina luziika. Mvutudileeno mvutu: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />nani wutambika Yoane mu botika, Nzambi hoti bantu e?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Banyunguta yawu na yawu na bata ti: ni twaavutula ti «Ku Nzambi», mbo kata ti: «Mu dyambu di nki lulembolo mukwikila e?» <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Tumana vutula ti: «Ku bantu», mukangu wumvimba waatuwinda matadi, mu dyambu ti mu mabanza mawu, Yoane mumbikudi wuba. <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Ni hahoho bavutula ti: «Tu zebyeto ko nani wumuhaana luve belolo.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu wuvutula ti: «Meno mpe naaluteela ko mu lutumu lunani nina hiidikila misamu bemimi.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki bisadi bimbi bimfuba yi vinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu wuta ku mukangu kingana eki: «Bakala dimosi dikuna mfuba yi miti mi vinu, wuhaana yo ku bisadi bi vinu mwanki bafutilanga yo, mpe wuyenda ntangu yiyingi mu nzyetolo. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Ntangu yi nyonzokolo bu yifwana, wutambika kisadi kimosi ku bisadi bimfuba yi vinu mwanki kenda kamubongila kikunku kyandi. Kansi bisadi bimfuba yi vinu batuuta kisadi bekyokyo nkuba na bamuvutula moko na moko. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Wubwesa tambika dyaka kisadi kihiika, kansi bamutuuta na bamusafula mpe bamuvutula moko na moko. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Wubwesa tambika dyaka wumitatu, bamulwekisa na bamukuma. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Mu nga mfuba andi yi miti mi vinu wuta bwabu ti: “Nki nasa e? Mbote na tambika mwana wutomini tya, kampe baamuvumina.” <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Kansi bisadi bi mfuba yi miti mi vinu bu bamuyena, bateelasana yawu na yawu ti: “Taleno wabyadila fwa. Tumuhondeno mwanki tu byadila dyo!” <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Bamutuba ku mbazi yi mfuba yi miti mi vinu na bamuhonda. Mfumu yi mfuba yi miti mi vinu, nki kasa bwabu e?»<verse eid="LUK 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />«Bu kaakwiza, mbo kahondisa bisadi bebyobyo bi mfuba yi miti mi vinu na mbo kahaana mfuba yo ku bantu bahiika.» Bu bayuwa bobo, ni bata ti: «Bulendi ba ko!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Kansi Yesu wubatala na wuta ti: «Nkye mbangudulu tulendi haana ku masonama bemama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“Tadi dinyafuna bituungi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">dyeka tadi divudidi mfunu”<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Wonso muntu waabwa ha yulu tadi bedyodyo wa mwangana, dimana bwila muntu, dya mu kosona.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpaku yi Kayisali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Milongisi mi Misiku na mfumu zinganga-Nzambi basosa mu bwila Yesu mu ntangu beyoyo kwandi, mu dyambu ti bazaba ti kingana bekyokyo mu yawu kalongila kyo, kansi ni bayena bunkuta bu mukangu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Ni batona mu kwe langi Yesu. Bamutambikila minketi myedi yenikanga ha meso ma bantu ti yawu bantu balunungu badi, mwanki bamubakila kibila mu nzonzolo andi na bamuyekola ku luyalu na ku mfumu yi kizunga . <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Bantu bebobo bamufuula ti: «Mulongisi, tuzebi ti muludedomo kwe zonzilanga na kwe longilanga na wuswasikisanga bantu ko, kansi ngeye kwe longanga nzila yi Nzambi mu kedika. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Tuteeleti, nga Misiku myeto mikwe tuhaananga luve mu futa mpaku yi Kayisali hoti kaani e?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Kansi Yesu wubakula ti mutambu bamulebikila ni kabateela ti: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Ndongiseeno mbongo zi kisengo. Kini na nkumbu binani bidi mu mbongo zi kisengo bezizi e?» Bamuvutudila ti: «Bi Kayisali bidi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Vutuleeno bi Kayisali ku Kayisali, bi Nzambi ku Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Balembakana mu mubakila kibila mu mo makedi zonza ha ntadisi yi mukangu. Bapamuka mu mvutu yi kabahaana ni bayiza ba na swii.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyuhu mu mfulukulu yi bafwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Mwa kabu di basaduki bayiza ha ntadisi yi Yesu. Yawu bakwe kwikilanga mu mfulukulu yi bafwa ko. Bamufuula ti: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«Mulongisi, Mose wutusonikina ebu: “Tala ti bakala dikwela difwidi na lembakani mu buta kani mwana wumosi, mpangi andi yi bakala fweti kwela mukento bewowo mwanki kaahaana nkuna ku mpangi andi yi fwidi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Nsambwadi baba mu kimpangi kyawu. wuntete wukwela na wufwa, kasa buta mwana ko. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Wunzole kwedidi mukento bewowo, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />mboki wumitatu mpe. Bumosi mu mpangi za nsambwadi zimvimba. Bamana fwa, ka musa buta baala ko. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Ku manima, mukento mpe wuyiza fwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Mu kilumbu ki mfulukulu mu bafwa, mukento bewowo wunani waaba e? Mu dyambu ti yawu nsambwadi bamukwela!» <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Babakala na bakento ba nza beyiyi bakwe kwelananga, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />kansi babakala na bakento baayenika balunga mu fuluka mu bafwa na mu zinga mimvu ka mimvu, bakwe kwelanga ko. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Balendi bwesa fwa ko, mu dyambu ti bafwanakani na zimbazi. Baala ba Nzambi badi, mu dyambu ti bafuluka mu bafwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Mose wakata ti bafwa baafuluka. Wakazonzila mu musamu wu vunda di mwa muti wedi lema mu milaka mitiya, bu katumisina Mfumu “Nzambi yi Abalahami, Nzambi yi Isaaki na Nzambi yi Yakobi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Nzambi yi Nzambi yi bafwa ko, kansi yi bamoyo. Mu dyambu ti ku yandi, bamvimba ba bamoyo.» <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Mwa kabu di milongisi mi Misiku bavutula ti: «Mulongisi, tomini zonza bumbote.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Balenda dyaka mu muziika byuhu bihiika ko.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Davidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Bwedi tulendi singisila wo ti Klisto mwana wu Davidi kadi e? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Mu dyambu ti Davidi yandi bende wuta mu buuku di mikunga ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Mfumu Nzambi wuta ku Mfumu ani ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Yiza zakala ha lweka lu lubakala lwani,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Natee bu nasa ti mitantu myaku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:43">miba bitentekolo bi bitambi byaku.”<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Tala ti Davidi wuna mutumisina “Mfumu”, bwedi Mesiya kalendi bwesa bela dyaka mu mwana Davidi e?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusemba milongisi mi Misiku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Mu ntangu mukangu wumvimba wedi muyuwa, Yesu wuta ku milongoki myandi ti: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Kebeno kweno na milongisi mi Misiku! Batiidi mu kwe yungingi mu mazwele mamala. Bakwe tyanga benda bahekingi mbote zi buzitu mu byanzala. Bakwe tyanga mu sola bibuka bintete mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo na bibuka bi buzitu mu minkembo mi zindambisa. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Bakwe zyonanga bima bimvimba bi mafoola, na bakwe sanga zinsambulu zizila mu kiyenikisa. Baatambula mfundusu yi hyokidi kitezo.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Munkayulu wu foola di muwelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mlk 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu bu kazungisa meso, wuyena mvwama zedi tuulanga minkayulu mu kima ki minkayulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Wuyena mpe foola dimosi di muwelo dituula momo mbongo yi kisengo zole. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ni hahoho kateela ti: «Kedika nalutedidi, foola bedidi di muwelo divudidi haana mu bamvimba. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Mu dyambu ti bamvimba bahaana mbongo zilembolo ba nawu mfunu, kansi mu bumputu bwandi heeni zimvimba zibedi nandi nsatu mu diila.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwangusunu yi nzo-Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Mwa kabu di bantu dyedi zonzilanga kitoko ki Nzo-Nzambi mu matadi mandi na bima bihaanu ku Nzambi mu tomisa yo. Kansi Yesu wubateela ti: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Mu bilumbu bina kwiza, kwaabwesa sala kaa tadi dimosi ha yulu tadi nandi ko mu bibi bi luna yena. Bimvimba byaamana mwangana.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpasi na nkwamusu zina kwiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bamufuula ti: «Mulongisi, nkye kilumbu kwandi misamu bemimi myaahilama e? Nkye kidimbu kyaalonka ti bwabu mitudidi e?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu wuvutula ti: «Kebeeno kweno! Luhunukandi ko! Mu dyambu ti bantu babingi baakwiza mu nkumbu ani, baaluteela ti: “Meno ni Mesiya” mpe “Ntangu yifweni.” Kansi lubalandandi ko. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Bu lwaayuwa ti bana zonzila zimvita na bikindu, luyenandi bunkuta ko, mimvimba bemyomyo myaateekidila. Kansi yaa tumbu ba nsukunu yi nza ko.» <verse eid="LUK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Mboki wubwesa ta dyaka ti: «Bantu ba nsi yimosi banwanisa bantu ba nsi yihiika, bantu bantinu yimosi baanwanisa bantu bantinu yihiika. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Butoto bwaazakama, malema na mayela maa ba mu bizunga bibingi. Misamu minsisi myaabwa, mboki ku yulu kwaayenika bidimbu bingitukulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Kansi teekila misamu bemyomyo mituula, baalukanga, baaluyenisa mpasi, baaluyekula mwanki balufundisa mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo, na baalukotisa mu boloko. Mboki baalufundisa ha ntadisi yi zintinu na zimfumu zi luyalu mu dyambu di nkumbu ani. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Dyaaba hwahwa ku yeno mu nteela kimbangi. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Zabeeno ti luna dyambu di lwaateka kubika ko mu nwanina nitu zeno. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Mu dyambu ti mebende na luhaana mpova zi lwaazonza na ndwenga, mwanki mitantu myeno milembolo lubindisa mpaka na lubangisa. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Bibuti byeno, zimpangi zeno, bisi-kanda dyeno na zinkayi zeno baaluyekola. Babingi ha kati dyeno baahonda. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Bantu bamvimba baalubela mu dyambu di nkumbu ani. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Kansi, kaa mulengi wumosi wu mutu eno waakatuka ko. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Tatamaneeno: bwabobo lwaavuukisila luzingu lweno.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yelusalemi ya mwangana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mlk 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Bu lwaayena ti mbanza Yelusalemi yizungululu ku binwani, zabeeno ti ntangu andi ye mu mwangisa yeka lukufi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Ni hahoho, yobobo baaba ku Yuda bafweti tinina ku milandu, yobobo baba ku kati di Yelusalemi bafweti duuka, mboki yobobo baba ku mfuba balendi kota dyaka ku mbanza ko. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Mu dyambu ti byaaba bilumbu bi lufundusu, byaasa ti mimvimba mi mu Masonama ma Longo milunga. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Mu bilumbu bebyobyo, nkye mpila kyadi ku bakento baaba na mazimi na baanwika baala mabene! Mu dyambu ti mpasi zingitukulu zaabwa mu nza mpe nganzi zi Nzambi zaasemba mukangu bewowo. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Baabahonda mu sabala, baabanata zinkole mu nsi zimvimba zi banzenza, ba mwangisa beni Yelusalemi natee ntangu awu bu yaahwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwizulu yi Mwana muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Bidimbu byaayenika ku ntangu, ngonda na mbwetete. Mpe ha butoto, zinsi zaaba ku nsye mpasi zingitukulu, zaazaba ko nki balendi sa mu dyambu di lusuku lu mubu na bipo bi mamba. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Bantu baafwa mu bunkuta bu baabanza misamu myaahyoka ha luse lu butoto, mu dyambu ti lulendo lu mayulu lwaaningana. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Hahoho, lwaayenina Mwana muntu wuna kwiza mu matuti mu lulendo lu ngolo na mu nkembo yiyinene. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Misamu bemyomyo bu myaatona mu hilama, telameeno na nanguneeno mitu eno, mu dyambu ti nkudulu eno yeka lukufi.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana ki muti wu fike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ku manima, Yesu wubateedidi kingana eki: «Sungimineeno muti wu fike na miti mimvimba mihiika: <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />bu lwaayena ti makaya mawu matonini mu sasa, luzebi ti ntombo yeka lukufi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Bumosi mpe bu lwaayena ti misamu bemyomyo milungidi, zabeeno ti Kimfumu ki Nzambi kyeka lukufi. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Kedika nina luteela, mbandu beyiyi yilendi zimbala ko tala ti mimvimba mi lungidi ko. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Yulu na butoto byaahyoka, kansi mambu mani maahyoka ko.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukaya meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Kebeeno kweno! Mitima myeno mibandi ku nsye kinanga ki minkembo, ki kindufu na manyongo ma luzingu ko, nganunu kilumbu ki lufundusu kyaalukwizila na byu, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />bonso mpwasa, kyaakwiza ku bantu bamvimba ba mu nza. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Lubwandi tolo ko, kansi ntangu ka ntangu sambilangeeno, mwanki luvuuka mu misamu mimvimba myaalutudila na luba batelama ha ntadisi yi Mwana muntu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Mu mwini, Yesu wedi longanga mu nzo-Nzambi, kansi mu nkokila wedi kwendanga ha yulu mulandu wu Olive mu hyokisila mpimpa. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Namene, mukangu wumvimba wedi kwizanga ku yandi mu nzo-Nzambi mu muyuwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamukotila manenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Mukembo wu mampa ma kiputi kilembolo vimba, wuba kwe tumisinanga ti Pake wuba bela-bela. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Mfumu zinganga-Nzambi na milongisi mi Misiku basosa bwedi balendi hondila Yesu, kansi bedi yena mukangu bunkuta.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda wusosa mu yekola Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk 14.10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Satana wukota mu Yuda, yondowo wuba kwe tumisinanga ti Isikalyoti, na wuba wumosi mu milongoki kumi na myole <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Wuyenda mokana na bamfumu ba zinganga-Nzambi mpe na mfumu zi minkengi mi nzo-Nzambi, mu zaba bwedi kalendi bayekodila Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Batoma yangalala, mboki bayuwasana mu muhaana mbongo. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Wutambula na wutona mu sosa nkye ntangu yifwanakani yi kalendi bayekodila Yesu, kondo mukangu kazaba.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Milongoki mi kubika bindya Pake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Kilumbu ki mukembo wu mampa ma kiputi kilembolo vimba bu kitula, kilumbu bekyokyo ki bakwe haananga munkayulu we yoka wu mwana dimeme mu dyambu di mukembo wu Pake, <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu wutambika Petelo na Yoane, wubateela ti: «Yendeeno lukubika bindya bi Pake, mwanki tudyeeno.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bamufuula ti: «Kwedi tiidi tukubikila byo e?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Wubavutudila ti: «Bu lwaakota mu mbanza, lwaabwabana muntu wuna kwe naati sanga di mamba ha yulu mutu. Mulandeeno natee mu nzo yi kakwe kota, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />mboki teeleeno mfumu yi nzo ti: “Mulongisi ebu kakuteedidi: Kwedi ku kihinga ki naadila bindya bi Pake na milongoki myani e?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Waalulonka kihinga kikinene kitoma kubuku ku yulu mu nzo beyoyo yi kibanga. Ni mwamomo lwaakubikila bindya bi Pake.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bayenda, mpe babwana misamu bonso bu kabateedila myo na bakubika bindya bi Pake.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bindya bi Mfumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Ko 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Ntangu bu yifwana, Yesu wuzakala ha meza na zintumwa zandi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Wubateela ti: «Tuka ntama, na bedi nkatika na ngunda na luzolo mu dya neeno bindya bebibi bi mukembo wu Pake kintwadi neeno tekila na yena mpasi! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kedika nina luteela, naabwesa dya wo ko natee bu waalunga mu Kimfumu ki Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Buna yandi wubonga mbungu, wuvutula matondo na wuta ti: «Bongeno mbungu beyiyi na kabaneeno yo yeno na yeno. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Wukedika nina luteela, naabwesa nwa dyaka vinu ko natee Kimfumu ki Nzambi bu kyaakwiza.» <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Mboki wubonga dimpa, bu kamana vutula matondo, wubukuna dyo na wubahaana dyo, ni kata ti: «Yi ni nitu ani yihaanu mu dyambu dyeno. Sangeeno bobo mu mbambukilanga moyo.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Wusa bumosi mpe na mbungu, bu bamana dya, wuta ti: «Mbungu beyiyi ni luwawanu lumona mu menga mani matengolo mu dyambu dyeno. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Kansi taleno: yondowo waanyekola wu kintwadi nani ha meza bemama! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Mwana Muntu waafwa, bonso budi nzengolo yi Nzambi. Kansi nkya mpila kyadi ku muntu bewowo waamuyekola!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Yawu na yawu bafulasana mu zaba, nani mu yawu lendi hidika misamu mi mutindu bewowo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nani vudidi bunene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Milongoki myedi mi sa mpaka mu zaba nani hyokidi mfunu ha kati dyawu. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu wubateela ti: «Mintinu mi zinsi mikwe bayaalanga mu kingolo na yobobo bakwe batumanga batiidi batumusunu ti “Minsa-mbote” <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Kansi mu yeno ka bu belandi bobo. Mu dyambu ti yondowo hyokidi mfunu ha kati dyeno kaba bonso yondowo vudidi bulezi, mpe yondowo kwe tumanga kaba bonso kisadi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Bwedi luna banza, nani hyokidi mfunu, yondowo wu ha meza hoti yondowo wuna sala e? Ka ni muntu wu ha meza ko e? Meno niidi ha kati dyeno bonso muntu wuna sala. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Yeno ni bantu batatamani naani mu zimpasi zani, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />bonso Tata ani kampanina <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kimfumu; luyaalu</char></note>Kimfumu, bwabobo mpe meno naaluhaanina kyo: <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />mwanki ludya na lunwa ha meza mu Kimfumu kyani, mpe luzakala ha byandu bi kintinu mu fundisa makanda kumi na mole ma Isaeli.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuzabikisa ti Petelo waamubisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yesu wuta ku Simoni Petelo ti: «Simoni, Simoni! Toma yuwa: Satana wundombidi ka kaluningisa bonso bu bakwe yengisilanga mbutu zibele ha kiyengoso. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Kansi nakusambididi mwanki kiminu kyaku kilembolo zeza, mpe ngeye bu waavutuka ku meno, syamisa zimpangi zaku.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petelo wumuteela ti: «Mfumu, meno nkubamani mu kwenda naaku ku boloko mpe mu fwa naku.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu wumuteela ti: «Petelo, nina kuteela ti bubedidi, nsusu ya kikubila ko, ngeye waambisa nkumbu tatu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikebolo kimbongo, nkutu na sabala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Mboki Yesu wubateela dyaka ti: «Bu nalutambika kondo kikebolo ki mbongo, ka nkutu ko, mpe ka nsampatu ko, bwedi, kima ki lukondolo e?» Bavutula ti: «Kani, tukondolo kima ko» <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Wubateela ti: «Kansi bwabu, wonso wu nakikebolo ki mbongo ka bonga kyo, bumosi mpe ku yondowo wu na nkutu, mboki ku muntu lembolo sabala ka yadika kinkutu kyandi mwanki kasumba sabala dimosi. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kedika nina luteela, mambu bemama masonama mu dyambu dyani mafweti kwenda detila ti: “Bamutanga ha kati di bimpumbulu.” Misamu mintadidi mina lunga.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Bamuteela ti: «Mfumu, tala masabala mole.» Wubavutudila ti: «Bulungidi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusambila ha mulandu wu Olive</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu wutotoka na wuyenda ku mulandu wu Olive, bonso buba kifu kyandi. Milongoki myandi mi mulanda. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Bu batula ha kibuka bekyokyo, wubateela ti: «Sambileno mwanki lulembolo bwa mu ntontolo.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Mboki wubatatukila na wuyenda mwa hahala, mpe wufukama mu sambila <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />wuta ti: «Tata, tala ti tiidi, ntatudila mbungu beyiyi. Kansi, ka bonso bu ntiidi ko, kansi bonso buu luzolo lwaku.» [<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Ni hahoho, mbazi yimosi yi yulu yi muyenikina mu musyamisa. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Bunkuta bungitukulu bu mubaka, wusambila mu kibakala. Mpe kyufuta kyandi ki kituka bonso mabete mamenga medi dada ha nsi.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Bu kamana sambila, wutelama na wuvutuka ku kasisa milongoki myandi, kansi wuyenda babwana ku nsye tolo tu kyadi. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Wubateela ti: «Bila nki luna bwila tolo e? Telameeno na sambileno mwanki lu lembolo bwa mu ntontolo.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakengi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoa 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Kakimanisina mu zonza ko, mpumbu yi bantu yitula. Yuda, wumosi mu milongoki kumi na myole wedi kwe batwadi. Wufinama ha ntadisi yi Yesu mu mufiba. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Kansi Yesu wumuteela ti: «Yuda, mu kufiba wizidi yekodila Mwana Muntu e?» <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Bu bayena misamu myedi hyokanga, yobobo baba nandi kintwadi bamufuula ti: «Mfumu, tulendi nwanina mu sabala e?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Na wumosi mu yawu wukata mundongo wu mfumu nganga-Nzambi na wumuzenga kutu di lubakala. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Kansi Yesu wubateela ti: «Bikeno, bulungidi.» Wusimba kutu di muntu bewowo na wumunyakisa. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Mboki Yesu wuteela ku zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi, ku mfumu zi minkengi mi nzo-Nzambi na ku bakuluntu bayiza mu kwiza mukanga ti: «Yeno lwizidi na mbele zimvita na bibono, bonso ti kimpumbulu nidi. <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Bilumbu bimvimba nabedi neeno mu nzo-Nzambi, na lusosidi mu mbwila ko. Kansi bwabu yeka ntangu eno, na yi lulendo lutombe.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo wubisa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26.57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mlk 14.53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoa 18.12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Bu bamana mukanga, bamunata, na bamukotisa mu nzo yi mfumu nganga-Nzambi. Petelo wedi kwe balandi mwa kitatu. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Balemisa tiya ha kati di mbazi yi lupangu na bazakala. Petelo wuzakala ha kati dyawu. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Kisadi kimosi ki mukento wu muyena wuba wuzakala ha ntendo tiya, wumusungimina na wuta ti: «Bakala bedidi yanandi mpe babedi!» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Kansi mu bisa kwandi, wuta ebu: «Kani mama, namuzebi ko.» <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Mwa ntangu fyoti kwa yihyoka, wuhiika wumuyeni na wuta ti: «Ngeye mpe, wudi wumosi ha kati dyawu!» Kansi Petelo wuta ti: «Kani tata, kameno ko.» <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Ku manima ma kilokola kimosi, wuhiika dyaka wuyiza nyema ti: «Mu nkatika kedika, bakala bedidi mpe yanandi babedi, mu dyambu ti mwisi-Ngalili kadi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Petelo wuvutula ti: «Nzebi ko bwedi wuna saka ta!» Mu kilokola bekyokyo kwandi kikedi zonza, nsusu yikuba. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Mfumu wubangumuka na wusungimina Petelo. Petelo wubambuka moyo mu musamu bewowo Mfumu wu kamuteela ti: «Tekila nsusu yikuba bubedidi, ngeye wambisa nkumbu zitatu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Wutotoka ku mbazi na wutoma dila mu kyadi kikingi.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamutuka na bamuzuba bikoti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mlk 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Babakala bedi kenga Yesu bedi mutukanga na bedi muzubanga bikoti. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bedi mufukanga kini na bedi mufuulanga ti: «Bakula! Nani wukuzubidi e?» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Na bedi mutukanga bituku bimpila-mumpila.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ha ntadisi yi bakuluntu ba Bayudayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoa 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Bwisi bu bukya, mbuta zi bantu zi Bayudayo, zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na milongisi mi Misiku bakutakana. Na batwala Yesu ha ntadisi yi kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Bamufuula: «Ti ngeye wuu Klisto e? Tuteela wo.» Wuvutula ti: «Namana luteela wo, lwaankwikileno ko, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />namana luziika kyuhu, lwaamvutudileno mvutu ko. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Kansi kutonina ntangu beyiyi, Mwana Muntu waazakala ha kooko ku lubakala lu Nzambi yi lulendo.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Bamvimba bata ti: «Ni ngeye wuu Mwana Nzambi e?» Yandi wubavutudila ti: «Yeno luna ta wo ti ni meno.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Buna bata ti: «Tusidi dyaka na nsatu yi zimbangi ko! Yeto bende tuyudi mu makutu meto misamu mikatotodi ha munwa andi!»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ha ntadisi yi Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Kabu dimvimba di bakuluntu di Bayudayo batelama na banata Yesu ha ntadisi yi Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Bu bedi mufunda bata ti: «Tubweni muntu bewuwu buna wuna sindikila mukangu eto munangumuka, mulembolo mfuta mpaku yi Kayisali, mboki wukiteedi yandi bende ti, yandi ni Klisto, ntinu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilatu wumufuula ti: «Ngeye ni ntinu yi Bayudayo e?» Wumuvutudila ti: «Ngeye wuna we ta.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilatu wuteela zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na mukangu ti: «Mbeki kani kibila kye zengila muntu bewuwu lufwa ko.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Kansi batatamana muta ti: «Mu ndongolo andi wuna sindikila mukangu mu nangumuka. Wutona ku kizunga ki Ngalili na wuhyokidi mu kizunga kimvimba ki Yuda, bwabu weka ehaha.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ha ntadisi yi Elode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilatu bu kayuwa misamu bemyomyo, wubafuula ti: «Muntu bewuwu mwisi-Ngalili kadi e?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Bu kayuwa ti mu kizunga kyedi yaalanga Elode kafuma, wumufila ku Elode, mu dyambu ti wuba mu bilumbu bebyobyo ku mbanza Yelusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Elode bu kayena Yesu wutoma yangalala. Mu kikuumu ki kedi yuwanga tuka ntama mu yandi, wuba nangunda muyena ka sa kimangu ha meso mandi. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Wumuziika byuhu bibingi, kansi Yesu kamuvutudila mvutu ko. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na milongisi mi Misiku baba hoho, bedi mufundanga mu ngolo zimvimba. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Elode mpe na zimbulu-mbulu zandi bamuvweza. Ku manima bu bamana mu seha, na mu mulwika kinkutu kintoko beni, bamuvutula ku Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Mu ntama, Elode na Pilatu baba zimbeni, kansi mu kilumbu bekyokyo bayiza ba bakundi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bazengila Yesu lufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:11-26">Mat 27.11-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-15">Mlk 15.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoa 18.39–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilatu wukutikisa zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi, mfumu zi Bayudayo na mukangu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />wubateela ti: «Luntwadidi muntu bewuwu na lunteedidi ti wuna sindikila mukangu mu nangumuka. Kansi meno bu namufudidi ha ntadisi eno, mbeki kibila kye muzengila lufwa ko mu misamu mi luna mufundila. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Elode mpe kamubeki kibila ko, mu dyambu ti wumuvutudi. Ni hahoho, ku na musamu wu kasiidi ko waasa ti bamuzengila lufwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Bu namana muzubisa bikoti, kumanima mbo namuyambula.» [<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Konso mukembo wu Pake, Pilatu wuba na kifu kye yambulanga nkole yimosi.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Bamvimba mu kintwadi balokana ti: «Honda muntu bewuwu, na tuyambudila Balabase!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Balabase bamutuula mu boloko mu dyambu di nkindu yibwa mu kati di mbanza mpe wuhonda muntu. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilatu bu kaba na mayindu me yambula Yesu, wubwesa zonza dyaka ku mukangu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Kansi mukangu wumvimba wulookana: «Mukoma ha kulunsi! Mukoma ha kulunsi!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Mu nkumbu yi tatu, Pilatu wubafuula dyaka ti: «Nkye musamu wumbi kasiidi e? Mbeki kibila kye muzengila lufwa ko. Bu namana muzubisa bikoti, kumanima mbo namuyambula.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Kansi batatamana mu lookana mu ngolo, na balomba bamukoma ha kulunsi. Banunga mu dyambu di milooko myawu. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Pilatu ni kalungisa luzolo lwawu. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Wubayambudila muntu wu bedi lomba, wu batuula mu boloko mu dyambu di nkindu na kuhonda muntu, mpe wubayekodila Yesu, mwanki ba musa bonso bu batiidi.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakoma Yesu ha kulunsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Bu bedi kwe nati Yesu, babwana Simoni, muntu wu mbanza Sileni, wufuma ku mfuba. Bamukwikisa kulunsi, mwanki kenda dye nati ha manima ma Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Ha kati di kamba di bantu dyedi kwe mulandi muba na bakento bedi kwe didi na bedi kwe baabi ha ntulu mu dyambu dyandi. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu wubaluka ku babeela na wubateela ti: «Ndumba zi Yelusalemi, ludilandi mu dyambu dyani ko, kansi dileeno mu yeno bende na baala beno! <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kadi bilumbu bina kwiza bantu mbo bata ti: “Kyese ku bakento ba bisita, balembolo teka buta na balembolo teka nwika baala mabene!” <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Mbo bata ku milandu ti: “Tubwidileeno” na ku matenta ti: “Tufukeeno!” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Bamana sa bobo ku muti wumamba, bwedi baasa ku muti wuyuma e?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Banata mpe bimpumbulu byole bi babakala, mu bahondila ha kimosi na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Bu batula ha kifulu ki nkumbu «Kikonzongolo ki mutu», zimbulu-mbulu zikoma Yesu na bimpumbulu bya bibyole, wumosi ku lubakala na wuhiika ku lumoso. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />[Buna Yesu wuta ti: «Tata, wubayambudila, kabazebi ma banahidika ko.»] Zimbulu-mbulu zita hwadi mu kabana binkutu byandi. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Mukangu wuba wutelama hoho na wedi talanga. Bamfumu ba Bayudayo bedi museha muta ti: «Wuvuukisa bahiika, bwabu ka kivuukisa yandi bende, tala ti yandi ni Klisto, Nzambi wukasoodidi!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Mbulu-mbulu mpe zedi mu seha, na ziyiza ha ntadisi andi mu muhaana vinu dinsa, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />ni zita ti: «Tala ti ngeye ni ntinu yi Bayudayo, wukivuukisa ngebende!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Ha yulu kulunsi dyandi, basonika ti: «Yundu bewuwu ni ntinu yi Bayudayo.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Wumosi mu bimpumbulu bi bakoma ha kulunsi wedi mulehola, ebu: «Kambi ngeye ni Klisto e? Wukivuukisa ngebende na yeto mpe!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Kansi munandi wumusemba mu muteela ti: «Ngeye beki kitumbu kimosi nandi, wuna bunkuta bu Nzambi ko e?» <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Mu yeto kitumbu bekiki kifwana kidi, mu dyambu ti yeto tubeki musendo wu mavanga meto, kadi yandi kasiidi kani musamu wumbi ko. <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Na wuteela Yesu ti: «Yesu, mbambukila moyo bu waakota mu kimfumu kyaku.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu wumuvutudila ti: «Kedika nina kuteela: bubedidi, waaba nani mu paladiso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paladiso: kifulu ki kubukulu ku yobobo baanunga mu kilumbu kizimunina</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Ntangu ambata bu yedi fwana, tombe kiyiza bwa mu nsi yimvimba natee mu kilokola kitatu kumanima ma ntangu ambata, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />ntangu mpe yizimbala. Mulele wu bamanika ha nkotolo yi kihinga kilongo wukakuka ha kati-kati kutonina ku yulu natee ku nsi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu wulookana mu ngolo ti: «Tata, ha moko maku mvutudi mwela ani.» Bu kamana ta bobo, ni kafwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama, bu kayena misamu bemyomyo mihilama, wukembila Nzambi na wuta ti: «Kedika, muntu bewuwu muntu wulunungu kabedi.» <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Kamba di bantu dikutakana mu tala, bu bayena misamu myedi hyoka, bedi kwe baabi ha ntulu mu kyadi, bu bedi kwe vutuki. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Bakundi bandi bamvimba, na bakento bedi kwe mulandingi kutonina ku mbanza yi Ngalili, batelama kitatu mu tala myo myedi hyoka.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batuula nitu yi Yesu mu ndyamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Bakala dimosi diba mu kabu di bakuluntu di Bayudayo, nkumbu andi Yosefi, wuba muntu wumbote mpe wulunungu(wusungama, wuludedomo), <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />katambula nzengolo yi bonga bahiika ko, wuba mwisi-Alimate mbanza yi Bayudayo, na wedi kingilanga nyizulu yi Kimfumu ki Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Wuyenda yenikina Pilatu na wumulomba nitu yi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Wuyenda kulumuna yo ha kulunsi, wuzinga yo mulele wu lino na wutuula yo mu ndyamu yitobolo mu mulandu wu matadi, yilembolo teka dyamusu mvumbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Kiba kilumbu kimitanu, mpe saba buna yesaka tona. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Bakento bedi kwe mulandingi tuka ku Ngalili, bayenda ku ndyamu na batala bwedi batudila nitu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Mboki bavutuka mu kwe kubika mananasi na mafuta mamfuku yimbote. Bavunda mu kilumbu ki saba, bonso bubela Misiku myawu.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Mfulukulu yi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Kilumbu kilumingu, mu mene, bakento bayenda ku ndyamu na mafuta mamfuku yimbote ma bakubika. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bayenda bwana tadi dyedi kanga nkotolo yi ndyamu di nengomono ha ntendo. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Ni bakota momo, kansi bayena nitu yi Mfumu Yesu ko. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Bu bedi kwamusu mu mayindu mu dyambu bedyodyo, bayitukulu ni babakala bole balwata binkutu byedi lezima bayiza telama ha ntadisi awu. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Bayena bunkuta bungitukulu, na bayinika nse zawu ha nsi. Kansi, babakala bebobo ba bateedidi ti: «Mu dyambu di nki luna sosila muntu wumoyo ha kati di bafwa e? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ka ehaha ko, kansi fulukidingi. Bambukeeno moyo mu misamu mi kaluteela buna wakidi ku Ngalili <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />bu kedi tanga ti: “Bafweti yekola Mwana muntu mu moko ma minsumuki, baamukoma ha kulunsi, mboki waafuluka kilumbu kibitatu.”»<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Babambuka moyo mu misamu mi zonza Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Buna basisa ndyamu na bayenda yala mpolo ku milongoki kumi na wumosi na ku bamvimba bahiika. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Baba Maliya mwisi-Mangadala, Zani, Maliya ngudi yi Zaki. Na bakento bahiika baba nawu bayadila mpe zintumwa mpolo. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Kansi bakwikila mu misamu bemyomyo ko mibateela bakento, bayena myo mi buzengi. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Kansi Petelo wutelama na wuhitumuka ntiinu natee ku ndyamu. Wukondama, wuyena kaka bitende bi lino ha nsi. Mboki, wutoma yituku bubwingi mu misamu bemyomyo mihyoka na wuvutuka ku nzo andi.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu nzila yi Emawusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mlk 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Mu kyo kilumbu kwandi, milongoki myole miyenda ku bwala bumosi bu nkumbu Emawusi, wu kitatu na Yelusalemi, mu nyenda yi bilokola byole. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Bamokinina mu misamu mimvimba mihyoka koko. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Mu ntangu yi bedi kwe mokingi na hekasana zimvutu mu byuhu, Yesu yandi bende wuyiza ha baaba na wedi kwe yenzi ha kimosi nawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Bamuyena, kansi bedi lembana mu mubakula. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu wubafuula ti: «Nkye musamu luna kwe mokini mu nzila e?» Ni batelama na kyadi kyonso. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Yandi mosi mu ya babole nkumbu andi Kehopase wumuteela ti: «Mu Yelusalemi yimvimba, nganunu ngeye kwandi lembolo zaba misamu mi hyokidi bilumbu bebibi e?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Wubafuula ti: «Nkye misamu e?» Bamuvutudila ti: «Myo mitadidi Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti! Wubedi mumbikudi wululendo mu nsalulu na mu nzonzolo ha ntadisi yi Nzambi na yi mukangu wumvimba. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Zimfumu zinganga-Nzambi na zimfumu zeto zimuyekodi, mwanki zimuzengila lufwa, ni zimukomini ha kulunsi. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Yeto tubedi na kivuvu ti yandi waakuula Isaeli. Kansi tuka misamu bemimi mibwidi, kii kyeka ni kilumbu kibitatu. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Kansi, mwa ndambu yi bakento mu kabu dyeto batupamuni, bu bayenzi mu mene ku ndyamu, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />kansi kabayeni nitu andi ko. Bu bavutukidi, batuteedi ti zimbazi zibayenikini na zibateedidi ti Yesu moyo kadi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Mwa ndambu yi bantu ha kati dyeto, bayenda mpe ku ndyamu, bayena mimvimba bonso bakento bateela myo. Kansi yandi bamuyena ko.» <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Buna wubateela ti: «Kyadi ku yeno lulembolo ba na madyela, mitima myeno mikwe tumbu kwikilanga ko mu myo mimvimba mizonza mimbikudi! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Nga bufweni ko ti Klisto kayena mpasi bezozo teekila kakota mu nkembo andi e?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Mboki wubahaana mbangudulu yii mu Masonama mamvimba mi mu tadidi yandi, kutonina ku buuku di Mose natee ku mabuuku ma mimbikudi mimvimba.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Bu batuula bela-bela na bwala bu bedi kwenda, Yesu wusa bonso muntu wuna hyoka kwandi. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Kansi bamusimbidila, bamuteela ti: «Zakala neto, nkokila ye tula, bwisi mpe bwe yila», wukota mu nzo mu zakala nawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Bu kazakala nawu ha meza, wubonga dimpa wusakumuna dyo, wubukuna dyo na wubahaana dyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Mboki meso mawu mazibuka na bamubakula. Ni katumbu zimbala ha ntadisi awu. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Bateelasana yawu na yawu ti: «Ni hahoho mu nzila, mitima myeto mibedingi tiya-tiya bu kabedi kwe tuzonzisingi na tubangudidingi masonama e?»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Hansi na nsi, batumbu teelama na bavutuka ku Yelusalemi. Bayenda bata milongoki kumi na wumosi bayonzama na bampwanawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Babateela ti: «Kedika! Mfumu wufulukidi na wuyenikini Simoni!» <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Milongoki mya mimyole miyala mpolo zi misamu mihyoka mu nzila na bwedi babakudila Yesu bukedi bukuna dimpa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukiyenikisa ku milongoki myandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mav 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Bu bedi zonzanga bobo, Yesu yandi wukiyenikisa ha kati dyawu na wubateela ti: «Kiyenge kyeno!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Bayena bunkuta bubwingi na bedi tekita, yawu babanza ti mukuyu bayeni. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Kansi Yesu wubateela ti: «Bila nki lwekila yeku-yeku e? Bila nki lwekila na maketiketi mu mitima myeno e? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Taleeno moko na malu mani, nkatika ni meno! Nsimbeeno na ntaleeno, mukuyu kaa na musunya na bihisi ko, bonso bu luna yena, meno bii naani.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Bu kabateela bobo, wubalonka moko na malu mandi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Bu bedi lembo tumbu kwikila, mu dyambu ti baba mu kyese na bedi yituku, ni hahoho Yesu kabafuudila ti: «Mwa kima kineeno kye dya e?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bamuhaana kibuku ki mbizi yi mamba yikangulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Wubonga yo na wudya yo ha meso mawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Mboki, wubateela ti: «Misamu bemimi mya nedi luteelanga bu naba neeno kintwadi: bufweni ti mimvimba misonama mu Misiku mi Mose, mu mabuuku ma Mimbikudi na mu Mikunga milunga.» <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Yesu ni kabahaana madyela me bakudila Masonama. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Na wubateela ti: «Disonama ti Klisto fweti yena mpasi na kilumbu kibitatu, waafuluka mu bafwa, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />mu nkumbu andi baalongila ku zinsi zimvimba mvilukulu na ndemvokolo yi masumu, kutonina ku Yelusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Yeno lweka zimbangi zi misamu bemimi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Meno, naalutambika munkayulu wu lusila tata ani nsilulu. Ni hahoho, zakaleeno mu mbanza yi Yelusalemi natee bu lwaatambula lulendo lwaatuuka ku yulu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Banata Yesu ku yulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mlk 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mav 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ku manima, Yesu wubanata bela-bela na Betani, wulambula moko na wubasakumuna. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Bu kedi basakumunanga, wuhambana nawu na bamunata ku yulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Yawu, bu bamana mu fukimina, ni bavutuka mu kyese kikingi ku Yelusalemi, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />mboki bedi banga ntangu zimvimba mu nzo-Nzambi mu kembila Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>